<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="REV" style="id">- Benamanga Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Ugubutulo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ugubutulo weagavilwe Yohani</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ugubutulo</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ugu</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ugubutulo va</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yohani</para>
  <para style="mt">Ulongolelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Kiganulo kya Ugubutulo ndi kiganulo kya kusindila mulyagano limiya. Kangi nde kiganulo kya kusindila kyekisimbilwe na Mnyigendwa Yohani mumwaka va tisini na chihano peababilwe suwe Yesu musula lya 1.1. Kangi Yohani asimbile Njowo Nofu, Njowo Nofu ngita peisimbilwe na Yohani na baluwa chidatu chene ndi Yohana va kwanja na Yohani va uvili na Yohani va udatu. Ndeni ndeni Yohani ndi mnyigendwa yeakeliwe hilo na Yesu musula lya 13.23. Mwene akasimbile kiganulo iki kya Ugubutulo peagehe ukoya mukigunguli kya Patimo peawopilwe kwakuva lya kulanducha Njowo Nofu cha Yesu Kilisito musula lya 1.9.</para>
  <para style="ip">Natilo lya Yohani kusimba kiganulo iki ndi kuvagangamicha vanu davevikwimba vasigale kumwidikila Yesu Kilisito na kuvagita vahuvilile kwakuva chipindi cha kuwuya Yesu chigehe pepi musula lya 1.3 na 22.7. Yohani avasimbilie vanu vonda vevakumdikila Kilisito, hilo kwa mapinga saba ga vanu vevakumdikila Kilisito musula lya 2-3. Yohani ilonga iki kyeisimba ndi uvichi, musula 1.3 na itumila mifano myolofu mukiganulo kuhumulila makani geawonile. Kiganulo iki kiwana na pono padodo mupono lya Lyagano lya dahila, hilo mukiganulo kya Sakalia musula lya 6.1-8. Mingalapi saba na mibakuli saba giwana na matovo ga Nguluvi geavatovile Vamisili, mukiganulo kya Kuhuma musula lya 7-9. Kiganulo iki kya Ugubutulo kihumulila chipindi cha kusila kwa inyi, Yesu daivecha muwesa na vonda vevakumuhuvilila Yesu davakala mbepali pamwi na mwene. Kasi lya kiganulo iki kukulakilila na kukugavila luhuvilo kuva Yesu iwuya kisatu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gegagehe</para>
  <para style="io">Yohani ivanga kukisimba kiganulo iki kwa kulonga mwene ndi ani na aviye awanuke uvichi, musula lya 1.1—1.20.</para>
  <para style="io">Yohani ihecha unanzi kuhuma kwa Yesu kuhelela kwa mapinga saba ga vanu vevamdikile Kilisito, musula lya 1.1—3.22.</para>
  <para style="io">Baho, Yohani iganula fihondo saba, musula lya 4.1—8.5 na mangalapi saba, musula lya 8.6-11-19.</para>
  <para style="io">Kangi Yohani iganula lukani lwa maye yeakali idagwa na lyoka lyene mituwe saba, musula lya 12.1—14.20.</para>
  <para style="io">Pambele, Yohani isimbila kutigila mibakuli saba ga luvipo lwa Nguluvi, musula lya 15.1—16.18.</para>
  <para style="io">Pambele Yohani iganula Nguluvi peakuvawecha vachindwama vake ukoya kuluhano, musula lya 17.1—20.15.</para>
  <para style="io">Yohani imalila kusimba kiganulo iki kwa kuganula luhano lumiya na inyi miya vene daukwacha chipindi cha mwiso, musula lya 21.1—22.21.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="REV 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 1:1" />Ugu nde ugubutulo va Yesu Kilisito, agavilwe na Nguluvi neke avawonese vanyigendwa vake makani gyeging'ang'wa kuhumila pepi. Baho, Yesu Kilisito akamlagiliche ndumindumi vake va kuluhano kwa Yohani neke amgubutulie makani ago. <verse eid="REV 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 1:2" />Mwene Yohani akalongie makani gyonda gyealolile, makani ago ndi kutigila undakyene veugubutuliwe na Yesu Kilisito, ugo nde Luchowo lwa Nguluvi. <verse eid="REV 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 1:3" />Afunyilwe yula munu yeikwimba kiganulo iki na afunyilwe vala vevapulike njowo ichi cha uvichi ugu na kugakolela gyegasimbilwe mukiganulo iki, kwakuva chipindi cha makani aga gagehe pepi kuhumila.<verse eid="REV 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Unanzi kwa mapinga saba ga vanu vevamuidikie Kilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 1:4" />Nene Yohani, ndikuvasimbila nyenye mapinga saba ga vanu vevamuidikiye Kilisito gegagehe muinyi lya Asia.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 1:4">Ndikuvasukila usanzi na lutengamaso kuhuma kwa Nguluvi, yeagehe na yeakali na yeikwacha na kuhuma kwa Muhe saba vevakali pautalo lya kigoda kya ung'achale, <verse eid="REV 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 1:5" />na kuhuma kwa Yesu Kilisito, mwene figono fyonda ilonga unanzi va undakyene. Mwene nde va kwanja kuchulubuka na mwene nde mtavala va vang'achale vonda muinyi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 1:5">Yesu akutukela na kufuwa kwa mwene atuvikile pekesu kuhuma musambi chetu, <verse eid="REV 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 1:6" />akatugitile nefwe kuva ung'achale vake na vatekechi vake vevakumgumbanikila Nguluvi na Daada vake. Yesu Kilisito anjumwe na umwimike uveche kwa mwene mbepali! Ndakyene.<verse eid="REV 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 1:7" />Lole! Ikwacha mumafunde vanu vonda davakumlola ata vala vevamhomile mgoha. Na vanu va makabila gyonda muinyi iyi davamkivilicha mwene. Ndakyene daivecha ndeni! Ndakyene.<verse eid="REV 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 1:8" />Mtwa Nguluvi munya ludali ilonga, “Nene ndi Alufa na Omega, yani va kwanja na va mwiso, nene yendigehe na yendikali na yeikwacha.”<verse eid="REV 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yohani ilonga makani gewoniswe na Kilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 1:9" />Nene Yohani, lukolo venu kwa kwiwunga na Kilisito, yetwihuvulila pamwi na nyenye magudo Muung'achale vake kwakuva lya Yesu. Ndikali ndikasindikwe mukiwopo mukigunguli kyekikemelwa Patimo nongwa lyangu lya kulanducha Njowo cha Nguluvi na kulonga undakyene va Yesu. <verse eid="REV 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 1:10" />Mukigono kya kumfunya Mtwa, ndikali ndilongochwa Mumuhe va Nguluvi ndikapulike lichwi ngomi ngita lya ngalapi kumbele lyangu, <verse eid="REV 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 1:11" />ikilonga, “Simbe mukiganulo gala gyeukugalola na ukisindike kwa gala mapinga saba gya vanu vevamuidikiye Kilisito, ukoya Efeso na Similina na Peligamo na Tiatila na Salidi na Filadelifia pamwi na Leodekia.”<verse eid="REV 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 1:12" />Suwe, ndikasedukile neke ndilole ndi ani akali ilonga, ndikawene finu fyefigalanichwe kwa madini ga sahabu saba fya kuvikila taa, <verse eid="REV 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 1:13" />pagatigati pafinu fyefigalanichwe na madini ga sahabu akawonile munu ngita Mwana va Adamu akali afwalile lihingila litali na lifunga lya sahabu lwewopilwe pakihafu pake. <verse eid="REV 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 1:14" />Fwili chake chikali valafu pee, meho gyake gakang'alile ngita lwenge lwa lyoto. <verse eid="REV 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 1:15" />Lwayo chake chikali ngita saba yeinyanyilwe mulitanuli lya lyoto na lichwi lyake ikali ngita mahata. <verse eid="REV 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 1:16" />Muliwoko lyake lya ndewo akakolela nondwa saba na mumulomo gwake ukahumile kimage kikomi kyekitema kuno na kuno. Wuso vake ukali ung'ala ngita lichuwa lya pamunyi. <verse eid="REV 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 1:17" />Ila pendimuwene, ndikaguwe kumaguli gyake ngita munu yeafuwe. Baho, akavikile liwoko lyake lya ndewo na kundilongela, ubihile kogofya! Nene nde va kwanja na va mwiso. <verse eid="REV 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 1:18" />Nene nde wumi, yendikali ndifuwe ila nondee ulole ndiwumi mbepali! Nene ndigehe na umwimike pakyanya pa kufuwa na inyi lya vanu vevafuwe. <verse eid="REV 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 1:19" />Suwe, simbe makani geukugalola na makani gyegagehe nondee na makani dagebwituka pambele. <verse eid="REV 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 1:20" />Nondee ndisaka kukugalanulia kuva chila nondwa saba cheuchilolile muliwoko lyako lya ndewo na finu fyefigalanichwe kwa madini ga sahabu fya kuvikila taa. Chila nondwa saba ndi ndumindumi va vala mapinga saba gya vanu vevamuidikiye Kilisito, nafyo finu fyefigalanichwe kwa madini ga sahabu fya kuvikila taa saba ndi mapinga saba gya vanu vevamuidikiye Kilisito.<verse eid="REV 1:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="REV 2" />
  <para style="s">Unanzi kwa lipinga lya vanu vevamuidikiye Klisito lya ukoya ku Efeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 2:1" />Suwe, msimbilie ndumindumi yeihimilila lipinga lya vanu vevamuidikiye Kilisito lya Efeso kuva.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:1">Nene yendikolile nondwa saba muliwoko lyangu lya ndwewo na kugenda pagatigati pa fila finu fefigalanichwe kwa madini ga sahabu fya kuvikila taa. <verse eid="REV 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 2:2" />Ndichela magito gyako gyonda, peugita kasi kwa ukangafu na seukafwahile. Ndichela kuva seuwesa kuvahuvilila vanu vawofu na kuvagecha vonda vakwikemela kuva vene vanjagila, kuno hamu na veve uchelie kuva vadesi. <verse eid="REV 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 2:3" />Kangi, ndichela ugudile hilo kwakuva lya nene, ila uhuvilile na ata nondee seukafwahile. <verse eid="REV 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 2:4" />Ila ndisaka kukulongela nongwa lyako, kuva, nondee seukunikela nene ngita peukali ukunikela pamwandi. <verse eid="REV 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 2:5" />Suwe, uwuwike peugitile sambi, useduke na kuleka kugita sambi ukagite magito gala gya pamwandi. Ngita seuhongecha dandikwacha kwa veve na kuhecha finu fyefigalanichwe kwa madini ga sahabu kya kuvikila taa kuhuma pono pekigehe. <verse eid="REV 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 2:6" />Ila kugehe na lukani limwi lweugita unofu, ukugalema makani manjanganifu gyevagita Vanikolai, ago ata nene gandikugavipila.<verse eid="REV 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 2:7" />Mwene masigicha gya kupulika na apulike gala Muhe va Nguluvi geakuvalongela mapinga gya vanu vevakumuidikila Kilisito!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:7">Muwecha dandikumgita awese kuliya manunu ga libiki veuhecha uwumi. Libiki lulo ugehe kuluhano mumgunda mdodo va Nguluvi.<verse eid="REV 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Unanzi kwa lipinga lya vanu vevakumuidikila Kilisito va ukoya Similina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 2:8" />Msimbile ndumindumi yeihimilila lipinga lya vanu vevamuidikie Kilisito lya ukoya Similina kuva.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:8">Ugu ndi unanzi wihuma kwa yula va kwanja na va mwiso, yeakali afue na kuchulubuka na nondee agehe wumi. <verse eid="REV 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 2:9" />Ndichela magudo gyako na uhangala vako, ila veve ndi mumosi! Ndichela peuligwa avo vevakwikemela Vayawudi, ila se Vayawudi avo ndi lipinga lya Setani. <verse eid="REV 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 2:10" />Ubihile kogofywa magecho gyekukupata. Mpulike! Setani daakuvavika mukiwopo vamonga venu neke kuvagecha udikilo venu, nyenye damwipata utatala kwa figono kyumi. Muendelele kuvecha vadikilwa, nene dandikuvagavila ingela lya uwumi. <verse eid="REV 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 2:11" />Mwene masigicha na apulike gala gyeilonga Muhe va Nguluvi akuyalongela lipinga lya vanu vevamuidikiye Kilisito.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:11">Yeyonda yedaiwesa seihigwa ng'odo na kufuwa kwa awamu lya uvili.<verse eid="REV 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Unanzi kwa lipinga lya vanu vevamwidikiye Kilisito ukoya Peligamo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 2:12" />Msimbiliye, ndumindumi yeihimilila lipinga lya vanu vevamwidikiye Kilisito la ukoya Peligamo kuva.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:12">Aga nde njowo lya mwene yeali na kimage kikomi kye kitema kuno na kuno. <verse eid="REV 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 2:13" />Ndipachela pono peikala, ukwikala pono peitavala Setani ila veve nde mwidikilwa kwa nene. Seukakanile kulonga kuva ukundidikila nene ata chipindi Anitipa mswida yeakali mwidikila vangu, yeakadochilwe mumwani venu mkomi veakwikala Setani. <verse eid="REV 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 2:14" />Ila kugehe na makani madodo se manofu pakyanya lyako, kwakuva unavo vanu vevakolile mawulanicho gya Balamu, yula amuwulaniche Balaki kuvalongela Vaisilaeli vagite sambi kwa kuliya finu fyefitambikilwe kwa ling'omong'omo na kugita ugoni. <verse eid="REV 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 2:15" />Ndeni ndeni, povali vanu pagati lyenu, yevefuatila mawulanicho gya Vanikolai. <verse eid="REV 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 2:16" />Suwe, uhongeche! Ngaseuhongecha dandikwacha kisatu na kwitova na vanu avo kwa kimage kikomi kye kitema kuno na kuno kyekihuma mumulomo gwangu.<verse eid="REV 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 2:17" />Yeali na masigicha gyakupilika na apulike gala geilonga Muhe va Nguluvi kwa mapinga gya vanu vevakwimwidikila Kilisito.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:17">Mwene yeishinda dandikumgavila kyakula kyekikemelwa mana kyekifihilwe, nene dandimgavila liganga livalafu, lyelisimbilwe litawa limiya seakulichela munu, ila daakulichela yula munu dayeakuliwanuka.<verse eid="REV 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Unanzi kwa lipinga lya vanu vevamwidikie Kilisito ukoya Tiatila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 2:18" />Msimbiliye, ndumindumi yeihimilila lipinga lya vanu vevamwidikiye Kilisito la ukoya Tiatila kuva.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:18">Aga nde malichwi gya Mwana va Nguluvi, mwene meho gyake ndi ngita lwenge lwa lyoto na magulu gyake nde ngita shaba yeikwililwe hilo. <verse eid="REV 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 2:19" />Ndikuyachela magito gyako, lukelo gwako na ludikila lwako na kasi na uhuvililo vako na magito gyako nondee galutie hilo kuchumba pamwandi. <verse eid="REV 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 2:20" />Ila ndigehe na lukani lumwi selinofu, ukumhuvilila yula mdala Yesebeli akwilonga mwene mvichi, ila akuvawulanicha na kuvachanga vanyigendwa vangu neke vagite ugoni na kuliya kyakuliya kekitambikilwe kwa ling'omong'omo. <verse eid="REV 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 2:21" />Ndikamgavile figono fya kuhongecha sambi chake, ila akakanile. <verse eid="REV 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 2:22" />Pulikiche! Nondee dandikumgavila matamwa gyakumgudisa gyegyakumgita alemwe kulamka paulili. Na vanu vonda yevigona nave dandikuvagudisa hilo ngita sevahongecha sambi chawo. <verse eid="REV 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 2:23" />Kangi, dandikuvadocha vana vonda kwa utamwa mhofu. Baho, mapinga gya vanu vevamwidikiye Kilisito vachele kuva nene ndendilolesa numbula cha vanu na mahocho gyao. Kangi dandikumuhomba kila munu kuhumila na magito gyake.<verse eid="REV 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 2:24" />Suwe, ndikuvalongila nyenye vangi mukwikala Tiatila, nyenye semfwatile mawulanicho gya Yesebeli vala semwiwulaniche makani gya mugati hilo gya Setani. Kangi sendikuvahongechela malagilicho gyogyonda kugina chila chemukuchichela. <verse eid="REV 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 2:25" />Ila mwendelele kudikila unanzi vangu vemuwanuke suwe. Munidikile nene mbaka pendikwacha. <verse eid="REV 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 2:26" />Munu yeyonda daiwesa kugita gala gending'ang'a mbaka mwiso, dandikumgavila umwimike va kutavala vanu va inyi yonda. <verse eid="REV 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 2:27" />Daakuvalongocha kwa ludali, daakuvadenya fipande fipande ngita fiviya. <verse eid="REV 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="REV 2:28" />Ngita pendiwanuke umwimike kuhuma kwa Daada vangu na nene dandikumgavila yila nondwa lya pamilau.<verse eid="REV 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="REV 2:29" />Yeali na masigicha gakupulikila na apulike gala Muhe va Nguluvi akuvalongela gala mapinga ga vanu vevakumuidikila Kilisito!<verse eid="REV 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="REV 3" />
  <para style="s">Unanzi kwa lipinga lya vanu vevakumwidikila Kilisito ukoya Salidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 3:1" />Msimbile ndumindumi yeihimilila lipinga lya vanu vevakumuidikila Kilisito lya ukoya Salidi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 3:1">Ugu nde unanzi va yula yeali na Muhe saba cha Nguluvi na nondwa saba. Ndichela magito gyenu, muwoneka kuva wumi ila mufuwe! <verse eid="REV 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 3:2" />Lamuke! Ugagite gala makani manofu madodo gegasigiye gaveche na ludali, kwakuva ata ago gagehe pepi kufuwa, ndiwene kuva magito gyako segagehe ngita Nguluvi peikela. <verse eid="REV 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 3:3" />Suwe, uwiwuke gala geupulike na kuwulanichwa na kudikila, ubate unofu na kuleka sambi chako. Ila ukale kwa kumsuka Nguluvi, ngita sewigita ndeni dandikwacha ngita mhichi peikwacha, vala seuchela saa yendikwacha kwa veve. <verse eid="REV 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 3:4" />Ila kugehe na vanu vevakwimwidikila Nguluvi vadodo hela ukoya ku Salidi sevahafule uwumi vawo kwa kugita sambi. Suwe, avo davivecha pamwi na nene kuno vafwalile myenda mivalafu, kwakuva vanu ava ving'ang'wa kugitilwa ndeni. <verse eid="REV 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 3:5" />Munu yoyonda daiwesa, daifwaliswa mwenda mvalafu ngita avo. Nene dasenditiligicha litawa lyake mukiganulo kya Uwumi, ila dandikudikila kuva nde vanene pautalo lya Daada vangu na kuutalo lya ndumindumi vake.<verse eid="REV 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 3:6" />Mwene masigicha gya kupulika na apulike gala Muhe va Nguluvi, akuvalongela mapinga gya vanu vevakumwidikila Kilisito!<verse eid="REV 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Unanzi kwa lipinga lya vanu vevamwidikila Kilisito ukoya Filadelifia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 3:7" />Msimbile ndumindumi yeihimilila lipinga lya vanu vevamwidikiye Kilisito ukoya Filadelifia.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 3:7">Ugu nde unanzi uhumile kwa mng'alile na mndakyene, mwene agehe na udindulo va mng'achale Dawudi, vala kyeadindue kwihela yeiwesa kudinda, vala kyeadindile kwihela yeiwesa kudindula. <verse eid="REV 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 3:8" />Ndikugachela magito gyako. Lole, ndidinduwe mulyangilo pautalo lyako, vala kwihela munu yeiwesa kuudinda. Ndichele kuva una ludali ludodo ila ubatile mawulanicho gyangu na kulidikila litawa lyangu. <verse eid="REV 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 3:9" />Pulikicha! Ndikuvasindika kwa veve vanu va lipinga lyake Setani, vanu vevakwikemela Vayawudi, undakyene avo ndi vadesi. Dandikuvagita vache kukufugamila na davachela kuva nene ndikukeliye veve. <verse eid="REV 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 3:10" />Kwakuva ukalidikile luchowo lwangu lwa uhuvililo, dandikuvadima nyenye chipindi kya utumama kyekikwacha kya kuvagela vanu vonda muinyi chonda. <verse eid="REV 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 3:11" />Ndikwacha kwa veve kisatu. Muyakolele unofu ago ganofu gyemnagyo neke munu abihile kuvanyaga fupo lyenu lya usindi. <verse eid="REV 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 3:12" />Mwene yeiwesa dandikumgita kuva lisimbili mukaye lya Nguluvi vangu, vala seihuma ng'odo mumo. Ndeni ndeni dandisimba kukyanya lyao litawa lya Nguluvi vangu na litawa lya mwani mkomi va Nguluvi vangu, vene ndi Yelusalemu miya, veukwika kuhuma kuluhano kwa Nguluvi vangu. Kangi dandisimba kukyanya lyao litawa lyangu limiya.<verse eid="REV 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 3:13" />Yeyonda yeagehe na masingicha gya kupulika na apulikiche gala gegalongilwe na Muhe va Nguluvi kwa gala mapinga gya vanu vevamwidikiye Kilisito!<verse eid="REV 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Unanzi Kwa lipinga lya vanu vevamwidikiye Kilisito ukoya Leodekia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 3:14" />Msimbiliye ndumindumi yeihimilila lipinga lya vanu vevamwidikiye Kilisito lya ukoya Leodekia kuva.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 3:14">Ugu ndi unanzi uhumile kwa yula yeikemelwa Ena, muswida yeihela likolakola na mndakyene mwene nde luvangilo va kila finu fyeawumbile Nguluvi. <verse eid="REV 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 3:15" />Ndikugachele magito gyako! Ndichela kuva veve sevauchichimu vala sevaupiyo. Ngiba uveche uchichimu awu va upiyo! <verse eid="REV 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 3:16" />Ila kwakuva veve ndi lupyopyo, kuva veve semchichimu vala seva lyoto, dandikuvakana na dandikukulokola kuhuma mumlomo vangu. <verse eid="REV 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 3:17" />Veve wilonga, nene ndi mmosi, sendipwemwike na kila kinu, ndigehe na vala sendikela kinu kyokyonda. Ila seuchela kuva veve ndimsosovafu, munu va kutangwa na muhangala na ubofwike meho kangi yegehe ufula. <verse eid="REV 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 3:18" />Ndikukusuka ugule kwa nene sahabu yeinyanyilwe ku lyoto, neke uveche mmosi. Kangi ufwale mwenda mvalafu, neke ugubike uwumi vako va sambi neke ubihile kulola soni. Gule mgoda gwa kubaka kumeho neke ulole. <verse eid="REV 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 3:19" />“Vala ndivakeliye ndikuvalakilila na kuvatova. Suwe, ugangamale na useduke na kuleka sambi. <verse eid="REV 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 3:20" />Pulikiche! Ndimile pamlyangilo ndihodisa. Ngita munu yeyonda peapulika lichwi lyangu na kunidindulila mlyangilo, dandikwingila na dandiliya pamwi na mwene. <verse eid="REV 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 3:21" />Munu yeyonda daiwesa, dandikumdikila kwikala pamwi na nene pakigoda kyangu kya ung'achale ngita ndeni pendiwesile kukalila pamwi na Daada vangu pa kigoda kyake kya ung'achale.<verse eid="REV 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 3:22" />“Yeyonda yeali na masigicha gyakupulika na apulike makani gyealongile na Muhe va Nguluvi kwa lipinga lya vanu vevakumuidikila Kilisito!”<verse eid="REV 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="REV 4" />
  <para style="s">Kumfunya Nguluvi kuluhano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 4:1" />Pegakachumbile makani aga ndikalolile kuluwano kwa Nguluvi mlyangilo ugehe wachi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 4:1">Kangi ndikapulike lichwi ngita pendipulike pamwandi lipembe lya ngalapi ikalonga, “Wache ukang'ale kukyanya, neke ndikuwonese makani dagihumila pambele.” <verse eid="REV 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 4:2" />Baho baho, ndikalongochwa na Muhe va Nguluvi, pautalo lyangu kukali na kigoda kya ung'achale kuluhano, kyekikali kikalilwe na munu yumwi. <verse eid="REV 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 4:3" />Mwene yeakalile eng'anyima ngita langi dung'u gya maganga ga sendi ngomi. Kigoda ikyo kikali kichungutilwe na lupinde lwa ndonya veukali ung'anyime hilo ngita sumalidi. <verse eid="REV 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 4:4" />Kangi, kuchungutila ikyo kigoda kya ung'achale pakali na figoda isilini na fitayi na pakyanya pa figoda ifyo vakakalile vavaha isilini na vatayi, vevafwalile myenda mivalafu pee vakiva na ingela lya sambalawo pamituwe gyawo. <verse eid="REV 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 4:5" />Kwene kigoda kya ung'achale kukali kuhumila lung'ali na mudilimo gwa ladi. Kuutalo lwa kigoda kya ung'achale, pakali na taa saba chechikwaka. Ichi ndi Muhe saba cha Nguluvi. <verse eid="REV 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 4:6" />Kangi, pautalo lya kigoda kya ung'achale kukali na kinu ngita inyanza lya lundala yeing'ala hilo!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 4:6">Pagatigati pakigoda kya ung'achale na vala vavaha, pakali na fiwumbe fitai figehe na wumi. Vakachungutile lubali chonda cha kigoda kya ung'achale, kuno vagehe na meho kuutalo na kumbele. <verse eid="REV 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 4:7" />Ndena kiwumbe kya kwanja akali iwana na simba na kiwumbe va upili akali iwana ngita ngwada, vaudatu akali na wuso va munu na kiwumbe va utai akali iwana na ndapu yeiguluka. <verse eid="REV 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 4:8" />Fiwumbe avo fitai vakali na fipapatilo sita kila yumwi na meho kuchungutila muvili vonda, mbaka panyi lya fipapatilo. Pamihe na pamunyi sevalekile kusomola.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 4:8">“Mnga'alile, Mng'alile, Mng'alile ndi Mtwa Nguluvi munyaludali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 4:8">yeakali na yeagahe na yeikwacha.”<verse eid="REV 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 4:9" />Fiwumbe avo vatai vakali vakumnjuma na kumginya na kuhongecha, yula yeakalile pakigoda kya ung'achale, kangi yeakwika mbepali. Chipindi pevigita ndeni, <verse eid="REV 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 4:10" />vala vavaha isilini na vatai viguwa panyi lya yula yeakalile pakigoda kya ung'achale navo vakimgundamila yula yeikala mbepali, kuno vakuchifula ingela chawo na kuchivika pautalo lya kila kigoda kwa ung'achale, vakilonga, <verse eid="REV 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 4:11" />“Mtwa na Nguluvi vetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 4:11">wing'ang'wa kujumwa kuginywa na kuvecha na ludali wonda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 4:11">Kwakuva veve ndiuwumbile kila kinu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 4:11">kwa lukelo lwako fikaumbilwe na kangi fikwendelela kwikala.”<verse eid="REV 4:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="REV 5" />
  <para style="s">Kiganulo na Mwanang'ondolo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 5:1" />Baho, ndikawene paliwoko lyake lya ndewo yule yeakalile mukigoda kya ung'achale, kiganulo kyekisimbilwe lubali chonda na kuwopwa kangi kiwopilwe na unepo saba.<figure style="fig" file="03 Seals.jpg" size="col" ref="5.1">Kiganulo kiwopilwe na unepo saba</figure> <verse eid="REV 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 5:2" />Kangi, ndikamwone ndumindumi yumwi va kuluhano kwa Nguluvi mwene ludali hilo akilanducha kwa lichwi likomi, akilonga, “Ndi ani yeing'ang'wa kumatula fila finepo saba chechimatilwe na kudindula ikyo kiganulo?” <verse eid="REV 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 5:3" />Kwihela munu ukoya kuluhano, vala kukyanya lya inyi, vala panyi lya inyi lya vanu vevafuwe yeawesile kudindula kiganulo ikyo vala kukilola mugati. <verse eid="REV 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 5:4" />Suwe, nene ndikavembile hilo kwakuva sepakali na munu yeyonda yeahaguliwe kudindula kiganulo ikyo, vala kulola mugati. <verse eid="REV 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 5:5" />Baho, yumwi va vala vavaha akandilongiye, “Ubihile kuvemba! Lole! Simba va likabila lya Yuda, vaubabwa va mng'achale Dawudi. Mwene iwesa kumatula unepo saba na kukidindula kiganulo ikyo.”<verse eid="REV 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 5:6" />Ndena, ndikawene pala pakigoda kya ung'achale, Mwanang'ondolo imile. Kangi akali achungutile kila lubali na fiwumbe fila fitayi na vala vavaha isilini na vatayi. Akaonekine ngita ahinjilwe. Akali na mapembe na Meho saba. Meho ago nde Muhe saba cha Nguluvi achilagiche muinyi chonda. <verse eid="REV 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 5:7" />Mwanang'ondolo akachile na akakinyamula kila kiganulo kuhuma ku muwoko lyandewo va yula yeakalile mukigoda kya ung'achale. <verse eid="REV 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 5:8" />Baho baho, peanyamuwe kila kiganulo, vala fiwumbe pamwi na vala vavaha isilini na vatayi vakaguwe lufuma pautalo pa yula Mwanang'ondolo. Kila yumwi akali na ligombo na bakuli gyegamemile manung'ulilo, manung'ulilo ago nde masuko gya vanu va Nguluvi. <verse eid="REV 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 5:9" />Nawo vakasomola msambo miya, vakilonga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 5:9">“Veve ung'ang'wa kunyamula kiganulo ikyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 5:9">na kumatikwa unepo saba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 5:9">Kwakuva ukahinjilwe na danda lyako ivagula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 5:9">vanu va kuhuma mukila kabila na ngombelo chonda na kila inyi. <verse eid="REV 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 5:10" />Uvagitile vave ung'achale va vatekechi na vamgumbanikile Nguluvi vetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 5:10">navo davitavala muinyi.” <verse eid="REV 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 5:11" />Baho, ndikalolile ndikapulike lichwi lya va ndumindumi volofu hilo va kuluhano kwa Nguluvi. Vakali viimile kukichungutila kigoda kya ung'achale, pamwi na fiwumbe wumi na vala vavaha isilini na vatayi. <verse eid="REV 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 5:12" />Ndikuvapulikicha vakisomola kwa lichwi ngomi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 5:12">“Mwanang'ondolo yeahinjilwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 5:12">ing'ang'wa kuwanuka umwimike na umosi na uginyange.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 5:12">Ludali na uginyange na ukomi na njuma nde cha mwene!”<verse eid="REV 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 5:13" />Pambele ndikapulike fiwumbe fyonda ukoya kuluwano, muinyi na muinyanza fisomola pamwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 5:13">“Mwene yeakalile pakigoda kya ung'achale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 5:13">na Mwanang'ondolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 5:13">anjumwe na aginywe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 5:13">agavilwe uginyange na umwimike mbepali!”<verse eid="REV 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 5:14" />Na vala fiwumbe vitayi wumi vakalonga, “Ena!” Na vala vavaha isilini na vatayi vakaguwa ufuma na vakafunyile.<verse eid="REV 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="REV 6" />
  <para style="s">Mwanang'ondolo akumatula finepo saba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 6:1" />Baho baho, ndikawonile Mwanang'ondolo akumatula unepo kya kwanja pagati lya fila saba. Ndeni, ndikapulike yumwi va vala fiwumbe wumi vatayi akilonga kwa lichwi ngomi ngita lya mudilimo, “Wache!” <verse eid="REV 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 6:2" />Nene ndikalole pautalo lyangu pakali na falasi mvalafu. Ndeni, ndikamwene munu yula yeakang'ale falasi uyo akali na lukunji, mwene akagavilwe ingela lya ung'achale. Suwe, akahumile kuvawesa vanu na munya umwimike va kuendelela kuvawesa vanu.<verse eid="REV 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 6:3" />Baho, Mwanang'ondolo akamatule lunepo va uvili. Ndikampulike yula kiwumbe wumi va uvili akilonga, “Wache!” <verse eid="REV 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 6:4" />Baho, akahumule falasi yungi mdung'u hilo. Mwene yeakang'ie akagavilwe lipanga likomi na umwimike lwa kuhecha lutengamaso muinyi neke vanu vayidoche. <verse eid="REV 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 6:5" />Baho, Mwanang'ondolo akamatula unepo va udatu. Ndikampulike yula kiwumbe kiwumi kya udatu akilonga, “Wache!” Ndikalolile pautalo lyangu pakali na falasi yungi mtitu! Yeakang'ie akali na mzani va kugela kuno na kuno muwoko gwake. <verse eid="REV 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 6:6" />Ndeni, ndikapulike kila kyekikali ngita lichwi pagatigati lya vala fiwumbe wumi vatai ikilonga, “Jampani kimwi kya ngano kwa mahombo gya mnyigendwa kwa kigono kimwi. Majampani madatu ga upemba kwa mahombo gya mnyigendwa kwa kigono kimwi. Ila ubihile kuwananga mafuta gya miseituni vala divai!”<verse eid="REV 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 6:7" />Baho, Mwanang'ondolo akamatula unepo va utayi, ndikampulike kiwumbe wumi va utayi akilonga, “Wache!” <verse eid="REV 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 6:8" />Ndikalole pautalo lyangu pakali na falasi langi lya kifu! Yeakang'ie falasi yeakemelwe kifo na inyi lya vanu vevafuwe akali akimfwatila kwa kumbele lyake, navo vakagavilwe umwimike va lobo lya inyi kuvodocha vanu kwa fita na lumyai na matamwa na vang'oko vang'ali va inyi.<verse eid="REV 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 6:9" />Baho, Mwanang'ondolo akamatule unepo va uhano. Ndikawene panyi lya kya kindangavala kya kunyanyila mang'ung'unilo, muhe cha vala vevakadochilwe kwakuva lya kulanducha unanzi va Nguluvi na kwakuva kulonga gala gyevagawene. <verse eid="REV 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 6:10" />Suwe, vakavembile kwa lichwi likomi, “Veve Mtwa Nguluvi, veugehe Mng'alile na Mndakyene, pandili daukuvahiga vanu va muinyi na kuvapilusia makani manjanganifu geavatugitile na kutudocha nefwe?” <verse eid="REV 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 6:11" />Baho, kila yumwi vawo akagavilwe mwenda mvalafu na vakalongilwe vachinde chipindi fidodo, mbaka jumula lya lukolo vawo yaani vanyigendwa vayawo vadochwe ngita vawo pevadochilwe neke itimile. <verse eid="REV 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 6:12" />Pambele ndikalolile, ndikamwene Mwanang'ondolo akimatula unepo va sita, pakahumile na mhogoseko mkomi lya inyi na lichuwa likaveche lititu ngita mwenda va maloboto veuhonelwe kwa magala ga mene na mwechi vonda ukali mdung'u ndita danda. <verse eid="REV 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 6:13" />Nondwa chonda kuluhano chikaguwe kumganga ngita manunu gya likuyu filelenjwa pegiguwa chipindi libiki lyake peuhogoswa na lukala veupuga hilo. <verse eid="REV 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 6:14" />Lulanga luyagile ngita kiganulo yeinyengeliwe na kila kidunda na kigunguli kikahechilwe pekikali. <verse eid="REV 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 6:15" />Pambele, vang'achale vainyi na filongochi va vanu na vakomi va vapuga na vamosi na vene ludali kwa kila vasutu na munu pekesu, vakayifihile mumanga na mumigema ga fidunda. <verse eid="REV 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 6:16" />Vakagilongela fidunda na maganga makomi, “Mtugwiliye na mutufiye kutali na mwene yeakalile mukigoda kya ung'achale na mutuvike kutali na luvipo lwa Mwanang'ondolo! <verse eid="REV 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 6:17" />Kigono kile kikomi kyachile, kigono ikyo Nguluvi na Mwanang'ondolo davawonesa luvipo lwao. Wuli, nde ani daikwima?”<verse eid="REV 6:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="REV 7" />
  <para style="s">Vaisilaeli laki yimwi na Elufu Alobaini na Vatayi vivikwa unepo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 7:1" />Peamalile kugawona ago, baho ndikawene ndumindumi va kuluhano kwa Nguluvi vatayi vemile mulubali chitayi cha inyi. Vakichipinga lukala kuhuma mulubali chonda cha inyi, neke lukala lubihile kupungila kukyanya lya inyi vala kukyanya lya inyanza vala kusung'a libiki lyolyonda. <verse eid="REV 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 7:2" />Baho, ndikawene ndumindumi yungi va kuluhano ikang'ala kukyanya kuhuma lubali lwa pelihumila lichuwa, kuno akolile unepo va Nguluvi yeagehe wumi. Akavakemela kwa lichwi likomi na kuvalongela awo ndumindumi vatayi vevagavilwe umwimike gya kuhananga inyi na inyanza, <verse eid="REV 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 7:3" />“Mubihile kuhananga inyi vala inyanza, vala mibiki, mbaka petukuvavikila gumba pawuso cha vanyigendwa vonda va Nguluvi.” <verse eid="REV 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 7:4" />Baho, ndikapulike jumula vala vanu vevavikilwe gumba laki yimwi na elufu alobaini na chitayi va makabila gyonda gya Isilaeli. <verse eid="REV 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 7:5" />Vanu vevavikilwe gumba vevahumile mukabila lya Yuda vanu elufu kyumi na vavili na kabila lya Lubeni vanu elufu kyumi na vavili na kabila lya Gadi vanu elufu kyumi na vavili, <verse eid="REV 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 7:6" />na kabila lya Asheli vanu elufu kyumi na vavili na kabila lya Nafitali vanu elufu kyumi na vavili na kabila lya Manasi vanu elufu kyumi na vavili, <verse eid="REV 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 7:7" />na kabila Simoni vanu elufu kyumi na vavili na kabila lya Lawi vanu elufu kyumi na vavili na kabila lya Isakali vanu elufu kyumi na vavili, <verse eid="REV 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 7:8" />na kabila la Sabuloni vanu elufu kyumi na vavili na kabila lya Yosefu vanu elufu kyumi na vavili na kabila lya Benjamini vanu elufu kyumi na vavili.<verse eid="REV 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lipinga likomi lya vanu vevafwalile myenda mivalafu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 7:9" />Baho, ndikalolile pautalo lyangu pakali na lipinga likomi lya vanu kwihela munu yeyonda yeiwesa kuvalanga, kuhuma kila inyi na kuhuma kila kabila na lukolo kuhuma kila luga, vemile pautalo lya kigoda kya utwa na kuutalo lya Mwanang'ondolo. Vevakali vafwalile myenda mivalafu na vakolile makwati ga mitende mumawoko gyawo. <verse eid="REV 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 7:10" />Vene vakali vakitova kyowo kwa lichwi likomi vakilonga, “Ulowolo vetu wihuma kwa Nguluvi vetu, mwene akalile pakigoda kya ung'achale na kuhuma Mwanang'ondolo!” <verse eid="REV 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 7:11" />Vandumindumi va kuluhano kwa Nguluvi vonda vevakali vemile kuchungutila kigoda kya ung'achale na vala vavaha isilini na vatayi na fiwumbe vatai wumi. Vakaguwe ufuma pautalo lya kigoda kya ung'achale na kumulumba Nguluvi, <verse eid="REV 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 7:12" />vakilonga, “Ena! Nguluvi vetu injumwa na ahongechwe na aginywe kangi aveche na mwimike vonda na ludali, mbepali. Ndakyene!”<verse eid="REV 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 7:13" />Baho, yumwi va vala vavaha isilini na vatai vakanihuchile, “Vanu ava nde ani vevafwalikle myenda mivalafu? Na vahumile kwiya?”<verse eid="REV 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 7:14" />Ndikamhigile, “Mtwa veve ukuvachela.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 7:14">Mwene akalonga, “Ava nde vala vevahumile mumagudo makomi na vahechilwe sambi chawo kuchumbila kufuwa kwa Mwanang'ondolo na kuvafwalisa myenda mivalafu. <verse eid="REV 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 7:15" />Ava veukuvawona vagehe pautalo lya kigoda kya ung'achile kya Nguluvi na kumgumbanikila pamunyi na pamiye Mukaye lyake, na mwene yeikala pakigoda kya ung'achale na daakuvagubika kwakuva mwene agehe navo na kuvadima. <verse eid="REV 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 7:16" />Dasevivecha na njala vala ng'elu kangi. Lichuwa vala lifuke selikuvanyanya kangi. <verse eid="REV 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 7:17" />Kwakuva Mwanang'ondolo yeakali pagatigati lya kigoda kya ung'achale daivecha mkwamila vawo, mwene daakuvalongocha kuhelela mukilwitu cha malenga manofu. Nguluvi daifyangula mihochi gyawo gyonda kuhuma mumeho gyawo.”<verse eid="REV 7:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="REV 8" />
  <para style="s">Unepo va Saba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 8:1" />Kangi, Mwanang'ondolo akamatula unepo va saba, kuluhano kwa Nguluvi kukachikile yii! Kwa chipindi cha nusu saa. <verse eid="REV 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 8:2" />Baho, ndivawene vala vandumindumi saba vevikwima pautalo lya Nguluvi, na vakagavilwe lya ngalapi saba.<verse eid="REV 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 8:3" />Ndumindumi va kuluhano yungi yeakali na kiyonjo kyekigelanichwe kwa sahabu kya kunyanyila manung'ililo, achile na kwima pautalo lya kindangavala kya maganga kya kunyanyila. Akagavilwe manung'ililo neke aheche usembe pamwi na masuko gya vevahaguliwe vonda va Nguluvi. Usembe ugo uhechelwa pakindavala kyekichengilwe na maganga sahabu kyekigehe pautalo lya kigoda kya ung'achale. <verse eid="REV 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 8:4" />Lila lyosi va manung'ililo pamwi na masuko gya vanu va Nguluvi, fikahelele kukyanya kwa Nguluvi, kuhuma mumawoko gya yula ndumindumi va kuluhano. <verse eid="REV 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 8:5" />Baho, yula ndumindumi akanyamule kila kiyonjo kya sahabu kya kunyanyila manung'ililo, akavikile lyoto kuhuma mu kindangavala kya maganga, akatagile kukyanya lya inyi. Ikahumile lichwi lya lado ikadilima na lung'ali lya lado na mhogoseko va inyi.<verse eid="REV 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mangalapi saba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 8:6" />Suwe, vala vandumindumi saba vevakali na ngalapi saba vakajivikile unofu kwa kupula.<verse eid="REV 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 8:7" />Ndumindumi va kwanja akatalile kupula lingalapi lyake. Pakahumile na ndonya lya maganga na lyoto chechihanyangise na danda, vikatagilwe kwa ludali kukyanya lya inyi na selusi imwi lya inyi ikayanganike na selusi imwi lya mibiki ikapiye na makwati gyonda madodi gikapiye.<verse eid="REV 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 8:8" />Baho, ndumindumi va uvili akapule ngalapi lyake. Kinu ngita kidunda kikomi weukwaka lyoto kikatagilwe mu inyanza. Selusi imwi lya inyanza ikaseduke kuvecha danda, <verse eid="REV 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 8:9" />Selusi imwi lya viwumbe vene wumi vekwikala mu inyanza vikafuwe na wato mkomi chikefu chikapiye.<verse eid="REV 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 8:10" />Ndumindumi va udatu akapule ngalapi lyake. Nondwa ngomi yeikali ikwaka ngita lwenge, ikaguwe kuhuma kuluhano, ikaguliye selusi imwi lya migoka na filwitu fwa malenga. <verse eid="REV 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 8:11" />Nondwa iyo ikemelwa, “Ung'ali”. Selusi imwi lya malenga gakali mang'ali na vanu volofu vakafuwe kwakuva lya malenga ago yakali na ung'ali.<verse eid="REV 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 8:12" />Baho, ndumindumi va utayi akapulile lingalapi lyake. Baho, selusi imwi lya lichuwa na lya mwechi na nondwa chikatovilwe. Selusi imwi lya welu ikali kisi. Na selusi imwi lya pamunyi ikali ihela welu na selusi imwi pamiye ikali ihela welu.<verse eid="REV 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 8:13" />Baho, ndikalolile na kupulika ndapu yumwi akiguluka kukyanya hilo kuno ekwimba kwa lichwi likomi, akilonga, “Sungamwilola, sungamwilola, sungamwilola! Nyenye vanu mkwikala muinyi, magudo makomi dagivanga baada lya ndumindumi vaudatu pevipula!”<verse eid="REV 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="REV 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 9:1" />Baho, Ndumindumi va uhanu akapulile lingalapi lyake. Ndikawene nondwa yeikali iguwe kuinyi kuhuma kuluhano, ikagavilwe udindulo va kudindulila lilindi lya inyi lya vanu vevafuwe. <verse eid="REV 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 9:2" />Nondwa ikalidinduwe lilindi lyelihelela inyi lya vanu vevafuwe, lyosi ukahuma mulilindi ngita lyosi weuhuma mulitanuli likomi hilo, lichuwa na lulanga fikali kisi kwakuva lya lila lyosi lyelihumile mulilindi. <verse eid="REV 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 9:3" />Midedema vakahumile mula mulyosi, vakahelele kukyanya lya inyi, vakagavilwe ludali ngita ludali cha kuluma ngita kinjemi. <verse eid="REV 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 9:4" />Vakalongilwe mbihile kuyaananga msoli gya inyi, vala mimelo vala mibiki gyogyonda, ila muvahanange vanu vevihela gumba lya Nguluvi pawuso chawo. <verse eid="REV 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 9:5" />Vakalagilichwa kuvaguda kwa myechi gihano, ila vabihile kuvadocha. Uvafi va kulumwa na midedema uveche ngita vanu vevalumilwe na kinjemi. <verse eid="REV 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 9:6" />Mukigono ikyo vanu davisaka lufuwo ila dasevakukipata, davidoboka kufuwa ila lufuwo dakikuvanyila.<verse eid="REV 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 9:7" />Midedema gila vakali na wumbo lya falasi vevaandaliswe kwa fita. Mumutuwe gyawo kukali na kinu ngita ingela lya sahabu na wuso chawo chiwana na ngita wuso va vanu. <verse eid="REV 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 9:8" />Vakali na fwili ngita vadadala na mino gyawo gakali ngita ga simba. <verse eid="REV 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 9:9" />Vihafu fyao fikali figubikwe na finu ngita ngawo lya kyuma. Na lichwi lya mapapatilo gyao gikali ngita mageleti gye gikwega na falasi gyegagehe mulugendo kuhelela mufita. <verse eid="REV 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 9:10" />Vakali na mikila gyegikali na mihomi ngita kinjemi, mikila ila ikali na ludali lwa kuvaluma vanu kwa chipindi kya miechi gihanu. <verse eid="REV 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 9:11" />Baho, vakali na mng'achale vawo, mwene nde ndumindumi va lila lilindi litali hilo inyi lya vanu vevafuwe, litawa lyake kwa Kibulania ndi Abadoni na Kigiliki ndi Apolioni mana lyake nde mhananga.<verse eid="REV 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 9:12" />Makani manjanganifu gya kwanja gachumbile, gave gangi gavili gikwacha.<verse eid="REV 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 9:13" />Pegachumbile ago, ndumindumi va sita akapulile lingalapi lyake. Ndikapulike lichwi ikahumile mu chila mipembe chitai cha kindangavala kyekichengilwe kwa maganga kya sahabu kya kunyanyila manung'ililo yeikali pautalo lya Nguluvi. <verse eid="REV 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 9:14" />Lichwi ilyo ikamlongiye yula ndumindumi va sita mwene lingalapi, “Valekelwe vala ndumindumi vatai vevawopilwe mula mumgoka mkomi Fulati.” <verse eid="REV 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 9:15" />Na vala vandumindumi vatai vakavopulwe vevakali vavikilwe unofu kwa yila saa na kigono na mwechi ugo na mwaka ugo, neke vavadoche selusi yimwe lya vanu vonda. <verse eid="REV 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 9:16" />Ndipulike volofu lyao, wolofu lya vapuga vakang'ala falasi vakali milioni miya chivili. <verse eid="REV 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 9:17" />Ndeni pendivawene avo vakang'ala falasi, vikang'ala falasi vakiva vafwalile mwenda va kyuma pakihafu, wukali na langi idung'u hilo na dakibuluu na langi ya baluti ndikawene fituwe fya falasi fikali ngita fituwe fya simba mulomo gwawo ikali ihumicha lwenge lya lyoto na lyosi na utine va kikwatilo. <verse eid="REV 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 9:18" />Selusi lya vanu vakafuwe na matovo makomi ago madatu, kwa lyoto na lyosi na baluti, yeyahumilwe mumulomo gya avo falasi. <verse eid="REV 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 9:19" />Ludali va avo falasi chikali mumulomo gwawo na mumikila gyawo, kwakuva mikila gyawo ikali ngita lyoka chechikali na mituwe gyevatumile kuvalemacha vanu. <verse eid="REV 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 9:20" />Vanu vangi muinyi sevakafuwe kwa magudo ago. Ila vanu avo sevakamuwuyile Nguluvi na sevakagalambuche mawocho gyao na kuleka kulumba finu fyevagelaniche kwa mawoko neke kulumba. Vala sevakalekile kulumba mahoka na ming'omong'omo gyegigelanichwe kwa madini gya sahabu na cha madini gya fesa na gya madini gya saba na maganga na mibiki, finu sefiwesa kulola vala kupulika vala kugenda. <verse eid="REV 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 9:21" />Vanu vala sevakamsedukile Nguluvi na kuleka magito gyawo manjanganifu gya kuvadocha vanu na uhavi na ugoni na uhichi.<verse eid="REV 9:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="REV 10" />
  <para style="s">Ndumindumi na kiganulo kidodo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 10:1" />Baho, ndikawene ndumindumi yungi va kuluhano kwa Nguluvi mwene ludali ikwika kuhuma kuluhano. Akali agubikwe na lifunde na linyuwa malenga pakituwe kyake. Wuso vake ung'alile ngita lichuwa mumutwe na magulu gyake ikali ngita lisimbili gya lyoto. <verse eid="REV 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 10:2" />Mumawoko gyake akali abatile kiganulo kidodo kyekikali kidinduliwe. Akauvikile ligulu vake wumwi va ndewo pakyanya lya inyanza na mgulu vake va kusoto akauvikile pakanya lya inyi ng'afu, <verse eid="REV 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 10:3" />akakemela kwa lichwi likomi ngita simba yeidilima. Peabwatuke kwa lichwi likomi, ndilimo saba ikapulikike. <verse eid="REV 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 10:4" />Ata milindimo saba peihumicha lichwi chawo, ndisaka kusimba gala gyegilongilwe na ludilimo, ila ndipulike lichwi kuhuma kuluhano ikalonga, “Njowo icho cha mdilimo chila saba nde lupwepo ubihile kugasimba!”<verse eid="REV 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 10:5" />Baho, yula ndumindumi yendimwene imile kukyanya painyanza na kukyanya painyi ng'afu akatanamule liwoko lyake lya ndewo kukyanya kuhelela kuluhano, <verse eid="REV 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 10:6" />akailapile kwa Nguluvi yeakwikala mbepali, yeaumbile luhano na inyi na nyanza na fiwumbe fyonda fyefigehe muinyi, akandilongiye, “Chipindi cha kuchindila kisilile. <verse eid="REV 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 10:7" />Ila chipindi yula ndumindumi va saba, daipula lila lingalapi lyake. Nguluvi daigita gala makani gyake gya lupyepo ngita peavalandulile vanyegendwa vake vavichi.”<verse eid="REV 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 10:8" />Baho, yila lichwi lyendikapulike pamwandi kuhuma kuluhano ikandilongiye kangi. “Helele ukanyamule kiganulo kyekigubutuliwe kikoleliwe na ndumindumi yeaimile pakyaya lya inyanza na inyi ng'afu.”<verse eid="REV 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 10:9" />Baho, ndikamhelelilye yula ndumindumi na kumsuka kila kiganulo kidodo. Akandongiye, “Nyamule kiganulo na uliye. Dakivecha na ung'ali mulileme lyako, ila mumulomo gwako dakivecha kinofu ngita luki.”<verse eid="REV 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 10:10" />Suwe, ndikakitolile kila kiganulo kidodo kuhuma mumuwoko va yula ndumindumi na ndiliye. Kikali kinofu mumulomo ngita luki, pendimilile kiganulo ikyo kikali king'ali mulileme lyangu. <verse eid="REV 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 10:11" />Baho, vakandongiye, “Ung'ang'wa kulonga uvichi ugu na uendelele kuvalongela vanu dakyekihumila muinyi cholofu na makabila gyolofu na luga chongofu na vang'achale volofu.”<verse eid="REV 10:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="REV 11" />
  <para style="s">Vaswida vavili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 11:1" />Baho, akandigavile ludete va kigelo yeukali ngita lubiki, ndikalongilwe, “Helele ukagele Kaye lya Nguluvi pamwi na kindangavala kya maganga, kangi uvavalile vanu vevilumba umo. <verse eid="REV 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 11:2" />Ila ubihile kuugela lidamo va kwivala lya Kaye lya Nguluvi, uwuleke kwakuva ugo vigavilwa vanu sevayahudi. Vene vakuukinyakinya mwani mng'alile kwa chipindi cha myechi alobaini na givili. <verse eid="REV 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 11:3" />Nene ndikuvagavila vaswida vangu vavili ludali, valonge uvichi kwa chipindi kya figono elufu yimwi na miya chivili na kyumi sita, vakiva vafwalile maloboto.”<verse eid="REV 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 11:4" />Ava ndi vala vaswida vavili na mibiki givili gya miseituni na kinu kyekigelanichwe kwa sahabu fiwili fya kuvikila taa fyefimile pautalo lya Mtwa Nguluvi va inyi yonda. <verse eid="REV 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 11:5" />Ngita munu yeyonda daikela kuvadocha, lyoto kuhuma mumulomo gyawo na kuvadocha vachwindama vawo. Ndena ing'ang'wa kufuwa munu yeyonda yeikela kuvalemacha. <verse eid="REV 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 11:6" />Ava vana umwimike va kudinda luhano neke ndonya ibihile kutonya chipindi chonda vene davisaka kulandula uvichi vawo. Ndeni ndeni davaveche na umwimike va kugalambula malenga kuva danda na kuitova inyi kwa kila ayina gya matamwa ngita pevakeliye.<verse eid="REV 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 11:7" />Suwe, pevasindile uswida vawo, yula mng'oko daihumila kuhuma mula mulilindi lya muinyi lya vanu vevafuwe selikali na mwisho akwitova nawo fita, pambele akuvadocha. <verse eid="REV 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 11:8" />Mifimba gyao gisigala mung'asi lya mwani mkomi, Mtwa vawo akong'oliwe pakipindilihicho. Na litawa lya mwani ugo kwa ng'ombelo lya kiuvichi nde Sodoma na Misili. <verse eid="REV 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 11:9" />Vanu va kila kabila na ng'ombelo chonda na inyi chonda na kila lukolo davakuchilola mifimba igyo kwa chipindi kya figono fidatu na nusu na dasevakuvalongela kusila. <verse eid="REV 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 11:10" />Vanu vevikwikala munyi davikedukila kwa kufuwa awo vavili. Davigita lihungu na kwigavila fupo kwakuva awo vavichi va Nguluvi vakavagudise hilo vanu vevakwikala muinyi. <verse eid="REV 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 11:11" />Ila pevichumbile figono fidatu na nusu, muhe lya uwumi kuhuma kwa Nguluvi ikavaingile, nawo vimile kwa magulu gyawo na vanu vonda vevalolile vingiye na wogofi hilo. <verse eid="REV 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 11:12" />Baho, vala vavichi vavili vakapulike lichwi kuhuma kuluhano ikuvalongela, “Mwache kuno kukyanya!” Nawo vakahelela kuluhano mumafunde kuno vachwindama vawo vakivalola. <verse eid="REV 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 11:13" />Bahobaho, kukahumila na mhogoseko mkomi va inyi na pono lya kyumi lya mwani ukaguwe. Vanu elufu saba vakadochilwe kuhumila na mhogoseko ugo, vene vevaponile vakaogwipe hilo na kumfunya Nguluvi va kuluhano. <verse eid="REV 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 11:14" />Magudo gya uvili gachumbile, lole magudo gya udatu gagehe pepi kwacha.<verse eid="REV 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngalapi lya Saba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 11:15" />Baho, yula ndumindumi va saba akapembile lila lingalapi lyake, pakahumila na lichwi likomi kuluhano yeilongile, “Ung'achale va inyi chonde nondee uvechile ung'achale va Mtwa vetu Kilisito mwene itavala mbepali na mbepali.” <verse eid="REV 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 11:16" />Baho, vala vavaha isilini na vatayi, vevakali vakalile pautalo lya Nguluvi, kwene figoda fya ung'achale vakaguwe ufuma na kumlumba Nguluvi, <verse eid="REV 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 11:17" />vakilonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 11:17">“Tukumhongecha Mtwa Nguluvi Mkombola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 11:17">yeali na yeakali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 11:17">uwonise umwike vako mkomi na nondee uvangile kutavala.<verse eid="REV 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 11:18" />Vanu sevakwidikiye va inyi yingi vakakuvipile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 11:18">kwakuva chipindi kya magudo kyachile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 11:18">Chipindi kya kuvahiga vanu vevafuwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 11:18">Ndeni ndeni ndichipindi kya kuvagavila fupo vanyigendwa vako vavichi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 11:18">vanu vonda va Nguluvi vevakulinjuma litawa lyako, vakomi kwa vadodo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 11:18">Nde chipindi kya kuvahananga vala vevihananga vanu muinyi.”<verse eid="REV 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 11:19" />Ndena, Kaye lya Nguluvi yeigehe kuluhano ikadinduliwe na lisanduku lya Lyagano lyake liwonike mugati lyake. Kukahumila ming'ali gya lado na midilimo na mhogoseko va inyi na ndonya ngomi lya maganga.<verse eid="REV 11:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="REV 12" />
  <para style="s">Mdalala na Liyoka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 12:1" />Baho, kukawoneka kimanyilo kikomi kya kududuvicha kuluhano. Pakali na mdala yumwi afwalile lichuwa na mwechi akiva panyi lya magulu gyake na ingela lya nondwa kyumi na chivili chikali pamutwe vake. <verse eid="REV 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 12:2" />Mdala uyo akali na lusololo akavembile hilo kwa uvafi kwakuva akali pepi kubaba.<verse eid="REV 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 12:3" />Baho, kikahumiye kimanyilo kingi kuluhano, likawoneke liyoka likomi lidung'u likali na mituwe saba na mapembe kyumi na kila kituwe kikali na ingela. <verse eid="REV 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 12:4" />Mkila va liyoka ukali ukuluwula pono yimwi cha nondwa cha kuluhano na kuchigwisa muinyi. Na lyene limile pautalo lya mdala yeali pepi kubaba neke peibaba hela amumile mwana uyo. <verse eid="REV 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 12:5" />Baho, maye yula peababile mwana mgosi, dailongocha inyi chonda kwa lusaga lwake lwa kyuma. Ila mwana uyo akanyamulwa na kusindikwa kwa Nguluvi mukigoda kya ung'achale. <verse eid="REV 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 12:6" />Mdala yula akanyilila kudasi, Nguluvi akali amwandalie pono neke apatile kwikala ukoya kwa figono elufu moja na miya chivili na sitini.<verse eid="REV 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 12:7" />Suwe, pakahumile na fita ukoya kuluhano. Ndumindumi yeikemelwa Mikaeli pamwi na vandumindumi vake vakatovine na lila liyoka pamwi na vandumindumi va liyoka. <verse eid="REV 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 12:8" />Ila liyoka na ndumindumi vake vakalemwile fita, ndena sevakalekilwe kangi kuvecha kuluhano. <verse eid="REV 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 12:9" />Suwe, liyoka likomi likatagwa panyi. Liyoka ilyo nde lila liyoka lya pamwandi lyelikemelwa Ibilisi awu Setani yeakachangile vanu vonda va inyi. Akatagilwe panyi muinyi, mwene pamwi na ndumindumi vake vonda.<verse eid="REV 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 12:10" />Baho, ndikapulike lichwi likomi kuhuma kuluhano, ikilonga, “Nondee Nguluvi vetu avalowola vanu vake, atumile umwike vake kuvanga utavala vake. Nondee Kilisito vake nave awonise umwimike vake. Avechile ndeni kwakuva mlata va vakolo vetu atagilwe panyi. Yeakali akuvalata pautalo lya Nguluvi pamiye na pamunyi atagilwe panyi. <verse eid="REV 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 12:11" />Vadikila vayetu, vamuwesile kwa danda lya Mwanang'ondolo na kwa unanzi va Nguluvi vevakavalongiye vanu. Vene vakaidikile kufuwa kuchumba kwikala. <verse eid="REV 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 12:12" />Ndeni, mkeduke nyenye vonda vemwikwikala ukoya kuluhano! Ila mwisungamwilola nyenye vemwikwikala muinyi na fiwumbe fyefikwikala muinyanza, kwakuva Setani ikile kwa nyenye, akiva avipile hilo, kwakuva ekwacha kwa chipindi kyake kidodo!”<verse eid="REV 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 12:13" />Liyoka peliwene atagilwe panyi muinyi, akamdagile yula mdala yeamubabile mwana mkigosi. <verse eid="REV 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 12:14" />Ila yula mdadala akagavilwe mapapatilo gavili gya ndapu mkomi avese kuguluka kuhelela ukoya kudasi pono yeigelanichwe na Nguluvi. Ukoya daidimwa kwa miyaka gidatu na nusu akiva kutali na liyoka. <verse eid="REV 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 12:15" />Suwe, liyoka akalokola malenga golofu ngita mgoka kuhuma mumulomo gwake, neke gamsung'e maye na kumdibacha mumalenga. <verse eid="REV 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 12:16" />Ila inyi ikamtanga maye yula. Inyi akajidinduwe ngita mulomo ikamila malenga gegahumile mumulomo gwa liyoka lila. <verse eid="REV 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 12:17" />Baho, lila liyoka likapatile luvipo lukomi kwakuva lya yula mdala, likahele kwitova fita na vana vevasigaliye va uyo mdala, vala vevakudikila malagilicho gya Nguluvi na vala vevikolela mawulanicho gya Yesu Kilisito. <verse eid="REV 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 12:18" />Liyoka lila likaimile mung'umbung'umbu mwa inyanza.<verse eid="REV 12:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="REV 13" />
  <para style="s">Vang'oko vang'ali vavili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 13:1" />Baho, ndikawene mng'oko yumwi mng'ali akihuma muinyanza. Mwene fituwe saba na mapembe kyumi na kila pembe ikali na ingela. Matawa gya kumliga Nguluvi gasimbilwe mumitwe gyake. <verse eid="REV 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 13:2" />Mng'oko yendimwene akali ngita duma, magulu gyake gakali ngita mng'oko ikemelwa dubu na mlomo vake ngita simba. Lila liyoka likamgavile ludali lwake na kigoda kyake kya ung'achale na umwimike mkomi. <verse eid="REV 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 13:3" />Kituwe kimwi kya mng'oko uyo kikawonike ngita kinakikong'o kikomi hilo, ila kikong'o ikyo kikananile. Vanu vonda va inyi yonda vakamfwatile. <verse eid="REV 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 13:4" />Vakagundamiye lila liyoka kwakuva akamgavile yula mng'oko uweso vake. Kangi vakamgundamiye yula mng'oko na kulonga, “Nde ani yeihwana na mng'oko uyo? Nde ani yeiwesa kwipinja na mwene?”<verse eid="REV 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 13:5" />Baho, mng'oko uyo akalongilwe alonge malichwi gya kwidumba na kumliga Nguluvi na kutumila umwimike vake kwa chipindi cha miechi alobaini na givili. <verse eid="REV 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 13:6" />Suwe, avangile kumliga Nguluvi, alilige litawa lyake na alige pono peakwikala na vonda vevakwikala kuluhano kwa Nguluvi. <verse eid="REV 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 13:7" />Kangi akagavilwe umwimike va kwitova fita na kuvavesa vanu va Nguluvi, akagavilwe umwimike kwa vanu va kila kabila ng'ombelo na inyi. <verse eid="REV 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 13:8" />Na vanu vonda vevikwikala muinyi davakumlumba mng'oko uyo. Ila sevala matawa gyao gyegasimbilwe kuhuma pamwandi peiwumbilwe inyi mukiganulo kya wumi va Mwanang'ondolo, yeainjilwe.<verse eid="REV 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 13:9" />Yeagehe na masigicha gyakupulika na apulike. <verse eid="REV 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 13:10" />Yeyonda yeing'ang'wa kuvecha msutu na mwene daivecha msutu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 13:10">yeyonda yeing'ang'wa kudochwa kwa lipanga, daidochwa kwa lipanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 13:10">Suwe, vanu va Nguluvi ving'ang'wa kuhuvilila na kudikila.<verse eid="REV 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 13:11" />Baho, ndikawene mng'oko yungi, ikang'ala kuluhano kwa Nguluvi kuhuma painyi. Akali na mapembe gavili ngita ng'ondolo, ila akalongile ngita liyoka. <verse eid="REV 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 13:12" />Nave akatumile umwimike vonda va mng'oko yula va kwanja na akatumile umwike uwo pautalo lyake. Akavaswitilicha vanu va inyi yonda vevagehe mumo vamlumbe mng'oko uyo va kwanja, yeakali na kikong'o kikomi hilo kyekinanile. <verse eid="REV 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 13:13" />Suwe, uyo mng'oko mg'ali va uvili akagitile umanyitu mikomi na akagitile lyoto ukwike kuhuma kuluhano kwa Nguluvi kuno vanu vilola. <verse eid="REV 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 13:14" />Akavachangile vanu va inyi kwa umanyitu gyeakali igita pautalo lya yula mng'oko va kwanja. Akavalongiye vanu vevakwikala muinyi vagelaniche ling'omong'omo kwa uginyange va yula mng'oko va kwanja, yeakali alemichwe kwa lipanga ila akananile. <verse eid="REV 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 13:15" />Baho, akagavilwe umwimike va kuipulilila muhe mulila ling'omong'omo lya mng'oko va kwanja, ata likawesile kulonga na kuvadocha vala vanu vonda vevakanile kuligundamikila ilyo ling'omong'omo. <verse eid="REV 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 13:16" />Kangi, akamuswitilicha kila yumwi, mdodo na mkomi na mmosi na mhangala na munu va pekesu na msutu, vavikwe gumba paliwoko lyao lya ndewo awu pawuso. <verse eid="REV 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 13:17" />Kwakuva munu yoyonda seivikwa gumba daseiwesa kugula vala kugucha. Gumba ilyo ndi litawa lya mng'oko va kwanja awu namba cha litawa lyake.<verse eid="REV 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 13:18" />Lukani ulu linga'ng'a uginyange! Munya luhala iwesa kuganula namba lya mng'oko uyu kwakuva nde namba lya munu tunga. Namba iyo ndi miya sita na sitini na sita.<verse eid="REV 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="REV 14" />
  <para style="s">Mwanang'ondolo na vanu vake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 14:1" />Baho, ndikawene Mwanang'ondolo imile pakidunda kya Sayuni na vanu laki yimwi na elufu alobaini na chitayi vaimile pamwi. Na vanu avo vakali na litawa lya Mwanang'ondolo na litawa lya Daada vake lisimbilwe pawuso gwao. <verse eid="REV 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 14:2" />Suwe, ndikapulike lichwi kuhuma kuluhano, ngita lichwi lya kibulubutu na ngita lichwi lya ladi ngomi. Ndeni, lichwi yendiipulike ndingita lichwi lya vatova ligombo vakitova ligombo lyao, <verse eid="REV 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 14:3" />na vakasomola msambo mya pautalo lya kigoda kya ung'achale na pautalo lya vala fiwumbe fitayi wumi na pautalo lya vavaha. Sepakali na munu yoyonda yeawesile kwiwulanicha msambo ugu, ila vala vanu laki imwi na elufu alobaini na chitayi vevakomboliwe kuhuma muinyi. <verse eid="REV 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 14:4" />Vanu ava ndi vala vevaihafuwe kwa kugona na vadala. Vene humfwatila Mwanang'ondolo kokonda peihelela. Vakali va kwanja kuhechelwa kwa Nguluvi na Mwanang'ondolo. <verse eid="REV 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 14:5" />Sevakalongile vadesi ng'odo, vala sevakali na nongwa lyolyonda.<verse eid="REV 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vandumindumi vadatu va Nguluvi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 14:6" />Baho, ndikawene ndumindumi yungi akiguluka palulanga, kuno akolile Njowo Nofu lya Nguluvi cha mbepali. Ayilanduche kwa vanu vekwikala painyi na kwa inyi yonda na makabila gyonda na vanu veviywanga ng'ombelo chonda na kila luga na lukolo chonda. <verse eid="REV 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 14:7" />Akalongiye kwa lichwi likomi, “Mumginye Nguluvi na kumnjuma, kwakuva chipindi kya Nguluvi kuhiga vanu vonda kyachile. Mgundamikila Nguluvi yeawumbile luhano na inyi na inyanza na filwitu fya malenga.” <verse eid="REV 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 14:8" />Ndumindumi va uvili yeamfwatile yula va kwanja akilonga, uguwe! Uguwe gula mwani yeukali mkomi va Babeli, mwani gula ukavagitile vanu va inyi chonda vanyuwe difai lyake. Difai lyake ng'ali lya ugoni vake.<verse eid="REV 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 14:9" />Ndumindumi va udatu yeavafwatile vala vavili, akalongiye kwa lichwi likomi, ngita kuna munu yeyonda akumgundamila mng'oko uyo na ling'omong'omo lyake na kuvikwa gumba pakipanji kya wuso vake awu liwoko lyake, <verse eid="REV 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 14:10" />mwene dainywa difaia luvipo lwa Nguluvi yeisukulilwe mumnechi lya luvipo lwake ngajila kuhanganiswa na malenga. Munu uyo daigudiswa mugati lya lyoto pautalo lya ndumindumi vang'alile na pautalo lya Mwanang'ondolo. <verse eid="REV 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 14:11" />Lyosi lya lyoto veukuvagudisa ukang'ala kukyanya mbepali na mbepali. Vanu avo vevakwimlumba uyo mng'oko uyo na ling'omong'omo lyake awu kwa yeyonda yeavikilwe gumba lya litawa lyake se itulula pamiye na pamunyi.<verse eid="REV 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 14:12" />Ndeni, vanu va Nguluvi vevikolela malagilicho gya Nguluvi na kumwidikila Yesu, ving'ang'wa kuhuvilila.<verse eid="REV 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 14:13" />Baho, ndikapulike lichwi kuhuma kuluhano ikilonga, “Simbe, vafunyilwe vala vonda kuvangila nondee yevifuwa kuno vamwidikiye Mtwa!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 14:13">Muhe va Nguluvi ilonga “Ndakyene! Davatulula kuhuma mukasi chawo ng'angafu, kwakuva magito gyao gyakuvafwatila.”<verse eid="REV 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vanu va inyi vibenwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 14:14" />Pendilolile pautalo lyangu pakali na lifunde livalafu, yeakali akalile kukyanya lya lifunde ilyo akawonike, “Ngita Mwana va Munu” yeali na ingela lya sahabu pamutuwe gwake na kikwakwa kyekitema hilo mumawoko gwake. <verse eid="REV 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 14:15" />Baho, ndumindumi yumwi akachile kuhuma mu Kaye lya Nguluvi akamukemeliye kwa lichwi likomi yula yeakalile kukyanya lya lila lifunde akalonga, “Nyamule kikwakwa kyako ukabene kwakuva chipindi cha mabenelo kifikile, kwakuva mabenelo gya inyi gakangiye.” <verse eid="REV 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 14:16" />Suwe, yula yeakali ikalile kukyanya lya mafunde, akahengile mabenelo gyonda gyegakangie muinyi na mabenelo gyake muinyi gakabenilwe.<verse eid="REV 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 14:17" />Baho, ndumindumi yungi kuhuma Mukaye lya Nguluvi ukoya kuluhano, nave akali akolile kikwakwa kyekifyulilwe hilo.<verse eid="REV 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 14:18" />Baho, ndikamwene ndumindumi yungi, yeakali na umwimike gya lyoto, akahumile masabawu, nave akamkeliye kwa lichwi ngomi yula ndumindumi yeakali na kikwakwa kyekifyulilwe hilo mumuwoko na akamlongiye, “Nave tumile kikwakwa kyako ukahengile kisanya fya misabibu gya inyi, kwakuva sabibu chake chikangiye.” <verse eid="REV 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 14:19" />Ndeni, yula Ndumindumi akadumula kisanya kwa kikwakwa kyake na kulundasa pamwi na kunokola sabibo gya inyi na kuvika pono pa kukamila difwayi. Pono baho pa kukamila difai nde luvipo lwa Nguluvi kwa vanu vevigita sambi. <verse eid="REV 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 14:20" />Sabibu chikakamilwe pono pa kukamila difai ndi kwivala lya mwani mkomi. Chikahumiche danda, na danda icho chikasukike na kuvecha mgoka mkomi. Ukomi vake ukali kilomita mia chidatu na utali vake kuhelela panyi ukali na futi chihanu.<verse eid="REV 14:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="REV 15" />
  <para style="s">Vandumindumi va kuluhano kwa Nguluvi saba na matovo makomi gya mwiso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 15:1" />Baho, ndikafiwene fimanyilo fingi fikomi lya filuviluwi palulanga, ndumindumi saba vevakali na matovo ga mwiso. Matovo ago pegisila Nguluvi daseivecha na luvipo kangi.<verse eid="REV 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 15:2" />Baho, ndikawene kinu kyekiwonike ngita inyanza lya lulandala yeihanganike na lyoto. Ndikawawene vanu vevamuwesile mng'oko na ling'omong'omo lyake na gumba lya litawa lyake vemile mung'umbung'umbu lya inyanza. Vanu avo vakali vakolile ligombogombo vevagavilwe na Nguluvi. <verse eid="REV 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 15:3" />Vene vakali vakisomola msambo va Musa, mnyigendwa va Nguluvi na msambo va Mwanang'ondolo vakisomola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 15:3">Mtwa yeugehe na umwimike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 15:3">magito gyako nde makomi na filuviluvi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 15:3">Veve nde ng'achale va vanu va inyi chonda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 15:3">Magito gyako gyeugita na gyeulonga nde gya undakyene!<verse eid="REV 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 15:4" />Nde ani daseakukogopa veve Mtwa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 15:4">Na kulinjuma litawa lyako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 15:4">kwakuva veve weka hela ndi msanzi hilo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 15:4">Vanu va inyi yonda davikwacha na kukulumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 15:4">na kukufunya kulutalo lwako</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 15:4">kwakuva magito gyako gyegihela sambi.<verse eid="REV 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 15:5" />Baho, pendiwonile ago, ndikalolile kangi ndikawene Kaye lya Nguluvi idinduliwe. Kaye iyoikali ngita kyama lya Nguluvi yeikali akwikala Nguluvi pagatigati lya vanu ukoya kukwelu. <verse eid="REV 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 15:6" />Mugati lya yila Kaye lya Nguluvi vakahumile vandumindumi saba vevakali na matovo saba. Vakali vafwalile myenda gyegihonile kwa kitambala kivalafu kyeking'ala na vayiwopile lufunga lya sahabu mukihafu kyawo. <verse eid="REV 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 15:7" />Suwe, yumwi va vala fiwumbe wumi vatayi akavagavila vala vandumindumi saba fimbunde saba fya sahabu fyefimemile luvipo lwa Nguluvi, mwene yeakwikala mbepali. <verse eid="REV 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 15:8" />Ukomi na ludali lwa Nguluvi ukagitile Kaye lya Nguluvi ikamemile lyosi. Sepakali na munu yeyonda yeawesile kwingila mu Kaye lya Nguluvi mbaka pegisila matowo saba gya vala vandumindumi saba.<verse eid="REV 15:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="REV 16" />
  <para style="s">Fimbunde saba fya luvipo lwa Nguluvi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 16:1" />Baho, ndikapulike lichwi likomi kuhuma Mukaye lya Nguluvi ukoya kuluhano ikivalongela vala ndumindumi saba va kuluhano kwa Nguluvi, “Muhelele mkasukule muinyi ifi fimbunde saba fya luvipo lwa Nguluvi.”<verse eid="REV 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 16:2" />Ndumindumi va kwanja achile kusukula kimbunde kya luvipo mukyanya lya inyi. Bahobaho, vanu vonda vevakali na gumba gya yula mng'oko na vevakali vafunyile ling'omong'omo lyake vakapatile mipu gyegivava hilo.<verse eid="REV 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 16:3" />Baho, ndumindumi va uvili akasukule kimbunde kyake muinyanza, malenga gyonda gakagalambuke kuva ngita danda lya munu yeafuwe na kila kiwumbe wumi kikwikala muinyanza fikafuwe.<verse eid="REV 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 16:4" />Ndumindumi va udatu akasukule kimbunde kyake mumgoka na mufilwitu fya malenga fyonda fikagalambuke danda. <verse eid="REV 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 16:5" />Baho, ndikampulike ndumindumi yegehe na umwimike kukyanya lya malenga gonda, akamlongiye Nguluvi, “Veve Nguluvi mng'alile yeugehe na yeukali! Veve uhigile ngita peukeliye. <verse eid="REV 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 16:6" />Kwakuva vakavadochile vanu va Nguluvi na vavichi, vavakavagitile vanyigendwa vako va hulule danda kufuwa nondee uvagavile vanu sevanofu danda vanyuwe. Ving'ang'wa kugitilwa ndeni!” <verse eid="REV 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 16:7" />Baho, ndikapulike kindangavala kya maganga ikilonga, “Veve Mtwa Nguluvi va umwimike vonda, peuhiga luhigo lwako lwihela luhumwilila ndeni nde ing'ang'wa.”<verse eid="REV 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 16:8" />Baho, ndumindumi va utayi akasukule kimbunde kyake mulichuva, likagavilwe ludali lya kunyanya vanu kwa lupiyo lyake. <verse eid="REV 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 16:9" />Baho, vanu vakanyanyilwe kwa lupiyo lulo, vakaliligile litawa lya Nguluvi, yeakali na umwimike kukyanya lya matovo agyo, kangi vakakanile kumsedukila Nguluvi na kumnjuma Nguluvi.<verse eid="REV 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 16:10" />Baho, ndumindumi va uhanu akasukule kimbunde kyake mukigoda kya ung'achale kya yula mng'oko mng'ali. Kisi ikagubike ung'achale vake vonda, vanu vakalumile lulimi chayo kwakuva lya uvavi vevaupatile, <verse eid="REV 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 16:11" />vakamligile Nguluvi va kuluhano kwakuva vali na uvavi na mipu yevakali nagyo. Ila sevalekile magito gyawo manjanganifu.<verse eid="REV 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 16:12" />Baho, ndumindumi va sita akasukule kimbunde kyake mumgoka mkomi yeukemelwa Filati, malenga gakagamile neke igelanichwe ng'asi lya vang'achale vevihuma kwekuhumila lichuwa. <verse eid="REV 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 16:13" />Baho, ndikawene muhe chidatu chihafu cha mahoka vevawane ngita midokwa. Yumwi akahumile mumulomo va liyoka, yungi kuhuma mumulomo va yula mng'oko mng'ali na yungi kuhuma mumulomo va yula mvichi va udesi. <verse eid="REV 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 16:14" />Muhe icho, chikali na umwimike va kugita umanyitu. Kasi chawo kuhelela kwa vang'achale vonda muinyi na kuvakung'asa kwakuva lya kutovana fita mukigono kila kikomi kya Nguluvi munya Umwimike.<verse eid="REV 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 16:15" />Suwe, Mtwa Yesu akalongile, “Mupulikiche! Ndikwacha ngita mhichi! Afunyilwe yula munu yeikwikala meho na kufwala myenda gyake neke abihile kugenda ufula na kupata nyoni.”<verse eid="REV 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 16:16" />Baho, muhe icho chikavakung'ese vang'achale pono pepikemelwa kwa Kibulania Halimagedoni.<verse eid="REV 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 16:17" />Baho, ndumindumi va saba akasukula kimbunde kyake kululanga na lichwi likomi ikahumila mula mukigoda kya ung'achale, Mukaye lya Nguluvi, ikilonga, “Isilile suwe!” <verse eid="REV 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 16:18" />Kukahumila na ming'ali gyongofu gya ladi na midilimo gyongofu na mhogoseko mkomi va inyi. Muhogoseko ugu ukali mkomi kuchumba gyonda kuhuma Nguluvi peawumbile munu muinyi. <verse eid="REV 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 16:19" />Baho, mwani mkomi va Babeli ukagavanyikile pono chidatu na myani mikomi gya inyi yingi ikatunywike gyonda. Nguluvi akauwuwike wula mwani mkomi va Babeli, akauswitilicha unyuwe mnechi va difayi lya luvipo lwake. <verse eid="REV 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 16:20" />Muhogoseko ula ukagitile figunguli fyonda fikayagile na fidunda fyonda sefikawoneka kangi. <verse eid="REV 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 16:21" />Ndoya ngomi lya maganga ikatonyile. Maganga makomi gegakali na usito va kilo hamsini kila limwi, gegaguwe kuhuma kululanga. Vanu vakamligile Nguluvi kwakuva matovo ago ga ndonya ga maganga, kwakuva gakavagitile magudo gyolofu.<verse eid="REV 16:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="REV 17" />
  <para style="s">Mdala msasi na mng'oko mng'ali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 17:1" />Yumwi va vala ndumindumi saba va kuluhano kwa Nguluvi vevakali na fimbunde saba achile na kulonga, “Wache, dandikuwonese Nguluvi peakuhinga wula mwani mkomi, yeakalile kukyanya gya malenga gyolofu. <verse eid="REV 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 17:2" />Vang'achale va inyi vakagonile na mwene, vanu vevakwikala ku inyi vakagalile kwa difwayi lya usasi vake.”<verse eid="REV 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 17:3" />Kangi, Muhe va Nguluvi akandinyamule mbaka kudasi. Ukoya ndikamwene mdala yumwi akakalile kukyanya lya mung'oko mdung'u, akamemile matawa gya kumliga Nguluvi muvili gyonda. Mng'oko uyo akali na mituwe saba na mapembe kyumi. <verse eid="REV 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 17:4" />Mdala uyo akali afwalile mwenda va langi lya sambalau na mdung'u. Kangi akali ilembile kwa finu fyefigelanichwe kwa sahabu na maganga ga sendi chongofu na madini gegikemelwa lulu. Mumuwoko gyake akali akolile mnechi va sahabu, mnechi uwo kikamemile mawofu manjanganifu na finu finjanganifu fyefiwonesa usasi vake. <verse eid="REV 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 17:5" />Pawuso vake pakasimbilwe litawa lya lupwepo, “Babeli mkomi, maye va vasasi na finu fyonda finjanganifu fyefigehe muinyi.” <verse eid="REV 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 17:6" />Ndikamwene yula mdala agalile danda lya vanu va Nguluvi na danda lya vanu vevadochilwe kwakuva lya kuvalongela vanu kutigila njowo cha Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 17:6">Pendikamwene mdala yula ndikaduduve hilo. <verse eid="REV 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 17:7" />Yula ndumindumi akandilongiye, “Kwa liki ukwikang'asa? Dandikulongiye lupwepo lya mdala yula na mng'oko yeakumnyamula yeali na fituwe saba na pembe kyumi. <verse eid="REV 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 17:8" />Mng'oko uyo yeumwonile pamwandi akali wumi na nondee afuwe. Ata ifyo agehe pepi kuhuma mulilindi lya inyi lya vanu vevafuwe, ila Nguluvi daakumuhananga. Vanu vakwikala mu inyi daviduduva, ena, avo nde vanu matawa gyawo segasimbilwe mu kiganulo kya uwumi kuhuma pamwandi pa inyi, davaduduva kumlola mng'oko yeakali wumi, baho akafuwe na nondee daikwacha kangi.<verse eid="REV 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 17:9" />“Baha ping'ang'wa luhala na uginyange! Fila fituwe saba ndi fidunda saba mdala uyo afikaliye kangi fituwe saba nde vang'achale saba. <verse eid="REV 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 17:10" />Pagati lya vang'achale saba, vahano vaguwe suwe na yumwi ave itavala na yungi ave kufika na daikwacha na kutavala kwa chipindi kidodo hela. <verse eid="REV 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 17:11" />Yula mng'oko yeakali akwikala pala pamwandi ila nondee seakwikala kangi nde mng'achale va nane, nave ndenindeni nde yumwi va vala saba na Nguluvi daakumdocha.<verse eid="REV 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 17:12" />“Chila pembe kyumi chiwonesa vang'achale kyumi vave kuwanuka ung'achale, ava vonda davawanuka umwimike va kutavala lisaa limwi na mung'oko uyo. <verse eid="REV 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 17:13" />Luhala va vang'achale ava kyumi viwana, nawo vakumgavila mng'oko uyo ludali lwawo na umwimike vawo. <verse eid="REV 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 17:14" />Davakwitova fita na Mwanang'ondolo, ila Mwanang'ondolo pamwi na vala veavakemeliye na kuvahaguliwa vevihela lukolakola, dakuvawesa kwakuva nde Mtwa na Mtwa na vang'achale va vang'achale.”<verse eid="REV 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 17:15" />Baho, akandilongiye yula ndumindumi, gala malenga geukagawene, agakalile kukyanya yula mdala msasi ndi mapinga gya vanu va kila inyi na ng'ombelo. <verse eid="REV 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 17:16" />Chila mapembe kyumi cheuchiwene na mng'oko, nawo vakumvipila yula mdala. Davakufinyamula finu fyake fyonda na kumleka ufula. Daviliya wuchi vawo na michege gyawo davitaga mulyoto. <verse eid="REV 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 17:17" />Kwakuva Nguluvi mwene akavagita vaweche na lihocho limwi lya kumgita mng'oko uyo umwimike vawo va kutavala. Avo davigita ndena mbaka gyealongile Nguluvi gaveche.<verse eid="REV 17:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 17:18" />Yula mdala yeumuwene ndi ula mwani mkomi. Umwani ugo ugehe na umwimike pakyanya lya ng'achale chonda cha muinyi.<verse eid="REV 17:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="REV 18" />
  <para style="s">Kuguwa kwa Babeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 18:1" />Baho, ndikawene ndumindumi yungi va kuluhano kwa Nguluvi ekwika kuhuma kuluhano kwa Nguluvi. Akali na umwimike mkomi na inyi ikang'alikwe kwa welu vake. <verse eid="REV 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 18:2" />Suwe, akalandula kwa lichwi likomi na akilonga, Uguwe, uguwe gula mwani mkomi va Babeli! Nondee uvechile pono pakwikala setani na mahoka na pono pa kwikala nyambongo mhafu. <verse eid="REV 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 18:3" />Kwakuva vanu va inyi chonda vakagalile difayi ng'ali lwa usasi vake na vag'achale va inyi vagonile nave. Na vachulusi va inyi vavechile vamosi kwakuva lya wongofu va finu fya mwani uwo.<verse eid="REV 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 18:4" />Baho, ndikapulike lichwi lingi kuhuma kuluhano ikilonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:4">vanu vangu muhege mumwani ugo!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:4">Neke mbihile kugita kyokyonda chevigita vanu va mwani ugo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:4">dasemwiwanuka magudo ambagyo Nguluvi dakuvagavila.<verse eid="REV 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 18:5" />Kwakuva sambi chake chilutiye hilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:5">chimemile mbaka kuluhano kwa Nguluvi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:5">na Nguluvi awiwuke kutova mawofu gyako.<verse eid="REV 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 18:6" />Mgitile ngita peavagitile nyenye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:6">mhombe mala chivili kwa gala gyeagagitile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:6">Mumhanganisile mumnechi vake difai ng'ali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:6">mala chivili lya difai yeavagavile nyenye.<verse eid="REV 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 18:7" />Mumtove na mgavile magudo ngita peakali akwidumba mwene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:7">na kuhumila kwa kwikala maisa manofu cheajipatiye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:7">Kwakuva akwilongela munumbula lyake, ndikwikala baha nene nde mdala va ng'achale.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:7">Nene semwigane vala sendivecha na uvafi!<verse eid="REV 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 18:8" />Kwakuva matovo gyake gakumpata kigono kimyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:8">matamwa na lusugwimo na lumyayi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:8">Na dainyanywa na lyoto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:8">kwakuva yeihiga ndi Mtwa Nguluvi mwene ludali.<verse eid="REV 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 18:9" />Vang'achale va inyi vevagitile usasi na mwene na kwikala maisa manofu gyake, dapeviwona lyosi lya kupiya kwa mwani ugo, davivemba na kumkivilicha. <verse eid="REV 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 18:10" />Vang'achale avo davikwima kutali na kuvemba kwa wogofi kuhumila na magudo gyake. Davivemba na kulonga, “Daulola, daulola! Mwani ula veugehe na ukomi, Babeli ndi mwani weuchelwa hilo na ugehe na ludali! Kwakuva kwa lisaa limwi Nguluvi akuhigile!”<verse eid="REV 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 18:11" />Vachulusi va inyi davivemba na kumkivilichila, kwakuva kwihela ata yumwi yeasigalile vakugula finu fyako, <verse eid="REV 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 18:12" />kwihela kangi vanu va kugula maganga gya sahabu na maganga gya feza na maganga gya samani ngomi na lulu. Mwenda va weuhonilwe kwa kitambala kivalafu na myenda gya sambalau na halili na myenda midung'u. Ayina chonda gya mibiki gya manung'ililo na finu fya mino gya ndembo na ayina gyonda gya mibiki gya galama hilo na saba nditu na kyuma na malumalu. <verse eid="REV 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 18:13" />Ayina chongofu mdalasini na ndimbililo na manung'ililo na udi. Difwayi na mafuta gya miseyituni na utine mnofu na nganu. Senga na ngo'ndolo na falasi na mageleti na vasutu na vanu vangi. <verse eid="REV 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 18:14" />Suwe, vachulusi davakumlongela, “Finu fyonda finofu fyeukeliye kuwanuka fihegile. Finu fyonda dafihega na fyeukuidumbila daseukufilola kangi!” <verse eid="REV 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 18:15" />Na vachulusi vevapatile umosi kwa mwani uwo, davakwima kutali, kwa wogofi va magudo gyake, davivemba na davikivilicha, <verse eid="REV 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 18:16" />Davilonga, “Makani mawofu gakuhumiye! Ula mwani veugehe mkomi. Veukali ufwaliswe mwenda veuhonilwe na kitambala kivalafu hilo na lya langi lya sambalau na idung'u, ikimelemeta kwa sahabu, maganga gya sendi ngomi hilo na maganga gya lulu! <verse eid="REV 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 18:17" />Kwa lisaa limwi hela umosi vako vonda uyagile!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 18:17">Filongosi vonda va wato mkomi na vanu vonda vevagehe mulugenda kwa wato mkomi. Vasola wato mkomi na vonda vevigita kasi muwato mkomi na vachuusi vevichuusa muinyanza davikwima kutali. <verse eid="REV 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 18:18" />Dapevilola lyosi na kupiya kwake ula mwani daviwemba na kulonga, “Kwihela, mwani wungi mkomi ngita ugu!” <verse eid="REV 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 18:19" />Vanu avo vakavembile hilo na kukivilicha na kwisukulila lifuna kukyanya gya mituwe gyawo kuno vakilonga, “Mawofu gakupatile! Veve mwani mkomi, mwani vonda ugehe na wato gyolofu muinyanza, vakapatile umosi kuchumbila myato gyako. Kwa lisaa limwi hela uyagiche kila kinu!”<verse eid="REV 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 18:20" />Mkeduke nyenye nyemwikukala kuluhano. Mkeduke kwakuva Nguluvi tovile mwani va Babeloni mkeduke vanu va Nguluvi na vachulila na vavichi! Kwakuva Nguluvi auhigile vanu va mwani ugo kwagala mawofu gyemkagitilwe nyenye.<verse eid="REV 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 18:21" />Baho, ndumindumi yumwi yeali na ludali, akanyamule liganga likomi lihwana na lwala akalitaga mu inyanza akilonga, “Ndeni nde mwani mkomi Babeli, daitagwa panyi kwa ludali vala daseuwoneka ng'odo. <verse eid="REV 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 18:22" />Lusambo lya vatowa ligombogombo na vasomola, vatowa mluli na lichwi lya vatowa ngalapi! Mbepali se lipulikika kangi mugati lyao, mugati lyao seiwoneka kangi mgelanicha yeyonda, vala lichwi lya liganga lwa lwala daseipulika mgati lyako! <verse eid="REV 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 18:23" />Welu gwa taa daseuwoneka mugati lyako kangi. Lichwi lya Mtwa va lihungu na mdala lya lihungu daseipulika mugati lyako kangi, vachulusi vako vakali vakomi mu inyi na inyi chonda ikachangilwe na uhavi vako!”<verse eid="REV 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 18:24" />“Mwani ugo ukatovilwe kwakuva lya kuvadocha vanu va Nguluvi, kukali na danda lya vavichi na vanu va Nguluvi pamwi na danda lya vanu vonda chikawonike muinyi.”<verse eid="REV 18:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="REV 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 19:1" />Pegachumbile makani ago, ndikapulike lichwi ngita lipinga likomi lya vanu kuluhano kwa Nguluvi vakilonga, “Ajumwe Nguluvi, ulowo na ukomi na umwimike wihuma kwa Nguluvi vetu. <verse eid="REV 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 19:2" />Kwakuva luhigo lwa Nguluvi ihela uhumwilila, Nguluvi akamuhigile yula msasi mkomi yeavagitile vanu vagite mawofu muinyi kwa usasi vake. Akamuhigile uyo kwakuva akadochile vanyigenda va Nguluvi.” <verse eid="REV 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 19:3" />Vakalonga kangi, “Anjumwe Nguluvi! Lyosi lya lyoto lyeunyanyile mwani mkomi dawikang'ala kukyanya mbepali!” <verse eid="REV 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 19:4" />Vala vavaha isilini na vatai pamwi na vala fiwumbe wumi vatai vakaguwe ufuma, vakamfunya Nguluvi yeakali akalile mukigoda kya ung'achale. Vakalonga kwa lichwi ngomi, “Ndakyene, anjumilwe Nguluvi!”<verse eid="REV 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kyakula kya lihungu lya kutola Mwanang'ondolo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 19:5" />Baho, ikahumile lichwi kuhuma pakigoda kya ung'achale, ikilonga “Mnjume Nguluvi vetu, nyenye vanyigendwa vonda, nyenye vonda vemukumginya hilo Nguluvi, vadodo na vakomi!” <verse eid="REV 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 19:6" />Baho, ndikapulike ngita lichwi lya lipinga likomi hilo lya vanu. Kangi lichwi ilyo likali ngita lichwi lya malenga pegipogoma ngita mdilimo gwa lado vakitova kyovo vakilonga, “Anjumwe Nguluvi! Kwakuva Mtwa Nguluvi vetu va umwimike vonda itavala. <verse eid="REV 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 19:7" />Tukeduke na tunemele na tumjume Nguluvi ukomi! Kwakuva lihungu lya Mwanang'ondolo lifikile na mdala va lihungu ayivikile unofu. <verse eid="REV 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 19:8" />Nguluvi akamgavile mwenda veuhonilwe kwa kitambala kivalafu hilo neke afwale, valafu yeimelemeta unofu.” Ugo mwenda mnofu nde magito manofu gya vanu va Nguluvi. <verse eid="REV 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 19:9" />Baho, ndumindumi va kuluhano kwa Nguluvi akandilongiye, “Simbe aga, vafunyilwe vala vevalalikwe mukyakula kya lihungu lya kutola lya Mwanang'ondolo!” Mwene akaendeliye kulonga, “Aga gyealongiye nde malichwi gya undakyene lya Nguluvi.” <verse eid="REV 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 19:10" />Baho, ndikaguwe ufuma pautalo lyake ndikasakile kumlumba, ila mwene akandilongiye! “Ubihile kugita ndena! Nene mnyegendwa myago pamwi na lukolo vako, vevali vaswida va Yesu. Mulumbe Nguluvi!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 19:10">Kwakuva uswida va Yesu nde ukuvang'alicha va uvichi.<verse eid="REV 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeakangiye Falasi mvalafu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 19:11" />Baho, ndikawene luhano ludindwike na pautalo lyangu pakali na falasi mvalafu, yeakang'ale falasi uyo akali yeihela likolakola na mndakyene. Kwakuva mwene ihiga ngita peing'ang'wa na akwitova fita <verse eid="REV 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 19:12" />Meho gyake ndi ngita lumuli lwa lyoto na kukyanya lya mtuwe vake kukali na ingela chongofu. Akali na litawa lyelisimbilwe lyeseachelile munu yungi ila mwene hela. <verse eid="REV 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 19:13" />Akali afwalile lihingila lyelijabikwe mudanda na litawa lyake ndi, “Luchowo lwa Nguluvi.” <verse eid="REV 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 19:14" />Mapinga makomi gyevakwikala kuluhano vakali vakimfwatila, vakiva vakang'iye falasi vavalafu, kuno vafwalile myenda gyeuwonile kwa kitambala kivalafu hilo na nofu hilo. <verse eid="REV 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 19:15" />Mumulomo gwake wihuma lipanga litema hilo daitumila kuvawesa vanu va inyi chonda. Mwene ndedaitavala kwa lusaga lwake lwa kyuma. Daakuikama mukinu kya kukamila sabibu va luvipo lukomi lwa Nguluvi munya ludali vonda. <verse eid="REV 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 19:16" />Palihingila lyake na pawuso gwake lisimbilwe litawa lyake, “Ng'achale va Vang'achale na Mtwa va Vatwa.”<verse eid="REV 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 19:17" />Kangi ndikamwene ndumindumi yumwi imile mugati lya lichuwa, akavakemeliye fidege wonda veviguluka kwa lichwi likomo, “Mwache, mwilundise pamwi kwakuva lya lihungu likomi lya Nguluvi, <verse eid="REV 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 19:18" />neke mwache kuliya huchi va vang'achale na cha va komi va vapuga na cha va vanu venye ludali na cha va falasi na cha lyavakang'ala falasi na huchi va vanu, vonda vevalekilwe na vachulila, vadodo na vakomi.”<verse eid="REV 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 19:19" />Baho, ndikamwene yula mng'oko mng'ali na ng'achale va inyi pamwi na mapuga gyawo. Baho, vakayilundise pamwi neke kutova fita pamwi na yula mkang'ala falasi mvalafu na vapuga vake. <verse eid="REV 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 19:20" />Ila yula mng'oko mng'ali akabatilwe pamwi na yula mvichi va udesi akali agitile kimanyilo kwakuva lya mng'oko uyo, kwa fimanyilo akavachangile vala vevawanuke gumba lya mng'oko uyo na kuifunya ling'omong'omo lyake. Ava vavili vakatagilwe vali wumi mgati lya lihiva lyelikwaka lyoto va kikwatilo, <verse eid="REV 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 19:21" />na vala vevasigaliye vakadochilwe kwa lipanga weuhumile mumulomo gwa yula yeakang'iye falasi mvalafu, ndapu vonda vakagwite kwa huchi cha vala vachindama vawo vevadochilwe.<verse eid="REV 19:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="REV 20" />
  <para style="s">Kilisito daitavala kwa myaka elufu yimwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 20:1" />Baho, ndikawene ndumindumi va kuluhano kwa Nguluvi yumwi ikwika kuhuma kuluhano, kuno abatile udindulo va lila lilindi litali lya inyi lya vanu vevafuwe na akiva na ndegeyi ngomi lya kyuma mumuwoko gyake. <verse eid="REV 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 20:2" />Suwe, ndumindumi yula akalikolela lila lyioka lya daha lyelikemelwa Ibilisi awu Setani, akamuwopile kwa ndegeyi lya kyuma kwa myaka elufu yimwi. <verse eid="REV 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 20:3" />Akalidagila mulilindi litali lya inyi lya vanu vevafuwe, akamdindila mlyangilo na kuvopa kihundo, neke abihile kwendelela kuchichanga inyi cholofu mbaka myaka igyo elufu imwi gisile. Pambele daadinduliwe kwa chipindi kidodo.<verse eid="REV 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 20:4" />Baho, ndikawene figoda fya ung'achale, fyefikali fikalilwe na vanu na vagavilwe umwimike va kuhiga. Ndikawene muhe gya vala vevadumulwe mituwe kwakuva lya uswida va Yesu na kwakuva lya luchowo lya Nguluvi. Avo sevamgundamiye mng'oko uyo vala ling'omong'omo lyake na sevakuwanuka yila gumba lyake pawuso gyawo awu paliwoko lyawo. Ndumindumi avo va Nguluvi vakapatile kangi uwumi na kutavala pamwi na Kilisito kwa myaka elufu yimwi. <verse eid="REV 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 20:5" />Vangi vevafuwe sevachulubuke kangi mbaka myaka elufu yimwi peichumbile. Ugu nde uchulubuko va kwanja. <verse eid="REV 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 20:6" />Ngulivi daakuvafunya hilo vala vanu veavachulubuwe mala lya kwanja! Kufuwa kya uvili uhela ludali pakyanya lyao, kwakuva davivecha vatekechi va Nguluvi na va Kilisito na davitavala pamwi na Kilisito kwa chipindi kya miyaka elufu yimwi.<verse eid="REV 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhanangwa kwa Setani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 20:7" />Pegichumba chipindi kya myaka elufu yimwi, Setani dailekelwa kuhuma mukiwopo, <verse eid="REV 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 20:8" />suwe, daihuma kwivala na kuvanga kuvachanga vanu vonda va inyi vevatavanyike kila pono muinyi, avo vanu vonda vevatawanyike kila pono muinyi, avo nde vachwindama va Nguluvi muinyi na vikemelwa Gogu na Magogu. Setani daakuvalundasa vanu avo kwakuva lya fita vanu avo davivecha vongofu ngita mhanga va muinyanza. <verse eid="REV 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 20:9" />Vene vakali vakigenda mupono lyonda lya inyi, vakichungutila kyama kya vanu va Nguluvi na ula mwani yeaukeliye Nguluvi. Ila lyoto kuhuma kuluhano kwa Nguluvi ukavakwikila na kuvadocha. <verse eid="REV 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 20:10" />Na Setani yeavachangile akatagilwe mulihiva lyelikwaka lyoto veseuchima pevakali vatagilwe yula mng'oko na mvichi va udesi. Davagudiswa kula pamunyi na pamiye, mbepali.<verse eid="REV 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Luhigo lwa kumalila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 20:11" />Baho, ndikawene kigoda kikomi kivalafu kya ung'achale na ndikamwene yeakalile pakigoda ikyo. Inyi na luhano chikanyilile pautalo pameho gyake na pono baho sepaonekine kangi. <verse eid="REV 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 20:12" />Pambele ndikawene vanu vevafuwe vakomi kwa vadodo, vakali vimile pautalo lya kigoda ikyo kya ung'achale na figanulo fikagubutuliwe. Baho, kiganulo kingi kya uwumi kikagubutulwe kangi. Vanu vevafuwe vakahigilwe kuwana na magito gyawo ngita peisimbilwe mufiganulo ifyo. <verse eid="REV 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 20:13" />Inyanza ikavahumicha vanu vevafuwe vevakali mugati lyake. Kufuwa na inyi lya vanu vevafuwe chikavahumicha kwivala vanu vevafuwe vevakali mugati lyake. Kila yumwi ihigwa kuwana na magito gyake. <verse eid="REV 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 20:14" />Baho, kufuwa na inyi lya vanu vevafuwe chikatagwa lihiva lya lyoto. Lihiva ilyo lya lyoto ndi kufuwa kya uvili. <verse eid="REV 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 20:15" />Munu yeyonda litawa lyake selisimbilwe mukiganulo kya uwumi, daitagwa mulihiva lya lyoto lyeseuchima.<verse eid="REV 20:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="REV 21" />
  <para style="s">Luhano miya na inyi miya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 21:1" />Baho, ndikawene luhano miya na inyi miya, kwakuva luhano ila lya pamwandi na inyi ila lya pamwandi chikali chichumbile suwe, vala sepakali na inyanza kangi. <verse eid="REV 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 21:2" />Ndikawene mwani va Nguluvi yumwene, veukemelwa Yelusalemu miya, wikwika kuhuma kuluhano kwa Nguluvi, ukiva ugelanichwe ngita mdala va lihungu afwaliswe unofu kwakuva lya mgosi vake. <verse eid="REV 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 21:3" />Baho, ndikapulike lichwi likomi kuhuma pakila kigoda kya ung'achale ikilonga, “Pulikiche! Nondee Nguluvi daakwikala pamwi na vanu. Akwikala mugati lyao, navo davivecha vanu vake na mwene daivecha Nguluvi vao. <verse eid="REV 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 21:4" />Mweni daifyangula kila lihochi lyelihuma mumeho gyawo, vala kufuwa sekuvecha kangi vala makivilicho vala kutamika kwakuva makani gya daha gakali gachumbile.”<verse eid="REV 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 21:5" />Yula yeakalile kukyanya lya kigoda kya ung'achale akalongile, “Lole, ndigita makani gyonda kuva miya!” Baho akalongile, “Simbe aga, kwakuva malichwi aga nde gya na undakyene na ging'ang'wa kwidikila.” <verse eid="REV 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 21:6" />Akandilongiye, “Ivechile suwe. Nene ndi Mwanso na Mwiso. Yeiwona ng'elu ndikumgavila kyakunyuwa kuhuma mukilwitu kya malenga gya wumi ngajila kuhomba kinu. <verse eid="REV 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 21:7" />Yoyonda yedaakumuwesa Setani, daiwanuka aga, nene dandiveche Nguluvi vake, kangi daivecha mwanavangu. <verse eid="REV 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 21:8" />Ila vanu vawogofi na sevadikila na vahafu na vadocha na vasasi na vahavi na vefunya ling'omong'omo pamwi na vadesi vonda, pono lyawo mulihiva lyelikwaka lyoto veseuchima na vakikwatilo. Iyi ndi kufuwa kwa uvili.”<verse eid="REV 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yelusalemu miya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 21:9" />Yumwi va vala ndumindumi saba vevakali na fimbunde saba gya ago matowo saba gya mwiso achile na kundilongela, “Wache, dandikuwonese mtwa va lihungu, mwene ndi mdala va Mwanang'ondolo.” <verse eid="REV 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 21:10" />Akanitolile kwa Muhe mbaka pakidunda kikomi na kitali, akiniwonesa wula mwani mkomi Yelusalemu wikwika kuhuma kuluhano kwa Nguluvi, <verse eid="REV 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 21:11" />ukali wing'ala kwa ukomi va Nguluvi, lulangala vake ngita liganga lya madini gyegikemelwa yasipi liganga ling'alile ngita inyanza lya lundala. <verse eid="REV 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 21:12" />Kukali na lukanji lukomi na mtali weugehe na milyangilo mikomi kyumi na givili, pakali na ndumindumi kyumi na vavili pa milyangilo igyo. Pamilyangilo igyo pasimbilwe matawa gya makabila kyumi na gavili gya Isiliaeli. <verse eid="REV 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 21:13" />Kukali na milyangilo mikomi gidatu lubali lwa kuhumila lichuwa na milyangilo mikomi gidatu kulidibala lichuwa na milyangilo mikomi gidatu kukyanya na milyangilo mikomi gidatu lubali lwa kwivindi. <verse eid="REV 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 21:14" />Lukanji va mwani ugo ukachengilwe kitamiko kya maganga kyumi na fiwili na pakyanya lya fitamiko ifyo gasimbilwe matawa gya vala vachulila kyumi na vavili va Mwanang'ondolo. <verse eid="REV 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 21:15" />Ndumindumi yealongile pamwi na nene akali na ndegeyi lya kigelo kya kugelela mwani ugo na kugelela milyangilo gyake mikomi na kugelela lukanji chake. <verse eid="REV 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 21:16" />Suwe, mwani ugo ukingika na utali vake uhwana. Akaugelanicha mwani ugu kwa ndegei akawene kuva ukali na kilomita elufu chivili na miya chitai, ukingika na utali vake va kuhelela kukyanya ukali wihwana. <verse eid="REV 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 21:17" />Ndumindumi akagela lukanji lwake udutu ukali mita sitini, kwa kigelo kya meho gya munu ndi kikila kya ndumindumi va kuluhano. <verse eid="REV 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 21:18" />Lukanji vake ukachengilwe kwa maganga madung'u gyegikemelwa yesipi kangi mwani gwene ukachengilwe kwa chumangandu nofu weung'ala ngita lulandala. <verse eid="REV 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 21:19" />Kitamiko kyake lukanji va mwani ugu ukalembichwe kwa kila ayina lya madini. Kitamiko kya kwanja ukali liganga lidung'u lya yespi na kitamiko kya uvili liganga lya safilo na liganga lya udatu lya kalekedoni na lya utai liganga lya sumalidi, <verse eid="REV 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 21:20" />na lya uhano liganga lya saludoniki na lya saba liganga lya kilisolitu na lya nane belulo na lya tisa liganga lya topasi na lya kyumi na limwi liganga lya yasitu na lyakyumi na givili liganga lya amesisito. <verse eid="REV 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 21:21" />Gila milyangilo mikomi kyumi na givili gikali gya lulu kyumi na givili, kila mulyangilo mkomi gumwi ugelanishwe kwa lulu yimwi. Ng'asi lya mwani ugo chikali cha sahabu nofu yeing'ala ngita lulandala. <verse eid="REV 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 21:22" />Sendiwene Kaye lya Nguluvi mugati lya mwani ugo kwakuva Mtwa Nguluvi Mkombola na Mwanang'ondolo ndi Kaye lya Nguluvi mumwani ugo. <verse eid="REV 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 21:23" />Mwani ugo sewikela lichuva vala mwechi kulangacha, kwakuva ukomi va Nguluvi ndi welu gwake na Mwanang'ondolo. <verse eid="REV 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 21:24" />Vanu va Inyi chonda davilangachilwa welu vake na vang'achale va inyi dafileta umosi vawo mugati lyawo mugati lya mwani ugo. <verse eid="REV 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 21:25" />Milyangilo mikomi gya mwani ugo segididwa ng'odo, kwakuva dakwihela pamiye. <verse eid="REV 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 21:26" />Vanu kuhuma inyi chonda davileta umosi vawo na finu fyawo fya sendi ngomi mumwani ugo. <verse eid="REV 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 21:27" />Ila kinu kihafu sekikwingila mu mwani ugo, vala munu yeigita makani gya soni awu gakuchanga. Ila davikwingila umo nde vala hela matava gyawo gasimbilwe mukiganulo kya wumi kya Mwanang'ondolo.<verse eid="REV 21:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="REV 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 22:1" />Baho, ndumindumi va Nguluvi akaniwonise mgoka va malenga gya uwumi weugehe wilangala ngita lundala, gakahumile mu kigoda kya ung'achale kya Nguluvi na Mwanang'ondolo. <verse eid="REV 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 22:2" />Mgoka uwo upogoma kuchumbila ng'asi yeigehe pagati lya mwani. Mukila mung'umbung'umbu lwa mgoka kugehe na libiki lwa uwumi wewibaba manunu mala kyumi na chivili kwa mwaka, yani mala yimwi kila mwechi na makwati gyake huvananicha vanu va inyi chonda. <verse eid="REV 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 22:3" />Kuhela kinu kyokyonda kyekikotoliwe dakivecha mumwani ugo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 22:3">Kigoda kya ung'achale kya Nguluvi na kya Mwanang'ondolo dakivecha mu mwani uwo na vandumindumi vake davamlumba. <verse eid="REV 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 22:4" />Davaulola wuso vake na litawa lyake dalisimbwa pakyanya lya wuso chawo. <verse eid="REV 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 22:5" />Pamiye sekuvecha kangi, vala seving'ang'a welu va lwenge awu va lichuwa, kwakuva Mtwa Nguluvi daavang'alichila na vene davitavala mbepali.<verse eid="REV 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwacha kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 22:6" />Baho, ndumindumi va kuluhano kwa Nguluvi akandilongiye, “Njowo ichi ndi cha undakyene na cha kwidikilwa. Mtwa Nguluvi eakuvalongocha vavichi vake valonge unanzi vake kuchumila Muhe vake amlagiche ndumindumi vake avawonese vachulila vake gala gegihumila pepi.”<verse eid="REV 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 22:7" />Yesu akalongile ndena, “Pulikiche! Ndigehe pepi kwacha. Afunyilwe yula yeakugakolela machowo gya uvichi va Nguluvi gyekagehe mukiganulo iki.”<verse eid="REV 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 22:8" />Nene Yohani, ndikapulike na kugalola makani aga. Pendikali ndigapulike na kugalola ndikaguwe lufuma pamagulu gya yula ndumindumi yeakali andiwonese makani ago. Neke ndimjume Nguluvi <verse eid="REV 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 22:9" />Ila mwene akanilongiye, “Ubihile kugita ndena! Nene ndi mnyigendwa ng'ani ngita veve na lukolo vako vavichi na vonda vevakwidikila machowo gya kiganulo iki. Mugondamile Nguluvi!” <verse eid="REV 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 22:10" />Baho, akandongiye, “Ubihile kugafiya machowo aga gya uvichi va kiganulo iki, kwakuva gyonda gyegalongilwe mukiganulo iki gagehe pepi kuhumila. <verse eid="REV 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 22:11" />Yeigita mawofu na yeigendelele kugita mawofo, yeigita uhafu na kugendelela kugita uhafu na mwene yeigita gyegyakumkelesa Nguluvi na agite ndeni na munu yeidikilwa pautalo lya Nguluvi aendelile ndeni.”<verse eid="REV 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 22:12" />Yesu ilonga, “Pulikiche!” “Ndikwacha kisato! Pamwi na fupo yedandikumgavila kila yumwi kuwama na magito gyake. <verse eid="REV 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 22:13" />Nene ndi Alufa na Omega, mana lyake ndi vakwanja na va mwiso va pamwandi na mwiso.”<verse eid="REV 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 22:14" />Vafunyilwe vala vevwikala hilo kwa kumlumba Nguluvi, neke vapatile kwidikilwa pautalo lya Nguluvi na kuhelela libiki lya uwumi na kwingila mumwani kuchumbila mulyangilo gya mwani ugo. <verse eid="REV 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 22:15" />Ila mibuwa na vahavi na vagoni na vadochaji vevifunya ling'omong'omo na kila, munu yeikela kuchanga davakwikala kwivala lya mwani ugo.<verse eid="REV 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 22:16" />“Nene Yesu, ndimlagiche ndumindumi vangu kulola makani aga kwakuva lya lipinga lya vanu vevamwidkiye Kilisito. Nene ndi ulelo va Dawudi, nde yila nondwa yeing'alicha pamilau.”<verse eid="REV 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 22:17" />Muhe na mdala va lihungu vakalongiye, “Wache!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 22:17">Kila munu yeipulika, ilonga “Wache!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 22:17">Yoyonda mwene ng'elu na ache na kila yeikela kunyamula malenga gya wumi anyumule anyuwe hela.<verse eid="REV 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kumalisila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 22:18" />Nene Yohani ndikuvalakalila nyenye vonda ve mupulika machowo gya uvichi va kiganulo iki. Munu yeyonda yeikongelecha kinu kyokyonda mumachowo agya, Nguluvi daakumwongechela magudo gyegasimbilwe mukiganulo iki. <verse eid="REV 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 22:19" />Ngita munu yoyonda akipungucha kyokyonda mumachowo gya uvichi va kiganulo iki, Nguluvi daakumnyaga pono lyake palila libiki lya wumi na ku mwani gula mkomi, chechisimbilwe mukiganulo iki.<verse eid="REV 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 22:20" />Munu mwene yeuhumicha uswida pakyanya lya makani aga alonge ndeni, “Ndakyene, ndacha kisatu!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 22:20">Ndakyene, wache Mtwa Yesu.<verse eid="REV 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 22:21" />Ndikuvang'angila vonda usanzi va Mtwa Yesu. Ndakyene.<verse eid="REV 22:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 22" />
</usx>